(74, 3, 'Playground Slides Manufacturer', 'playground-slides-manufacturer', 'active', 'Explore high-quality frp playground slides manufacturer in India, designed for schools, parks, and gardens. Durable, weather-resistant and low-maintenance perfect for high-quality indoor & outdoor playground equipments at competitive prices.'),
(75, 3, 'Indoor Gym Equipments Manufacturer', 'indoor-gym-equipments-manufacturer', 'active', 'Leading indoor gym equipment manufacturers in  Nagpur India By Sarwadnya Sports & Fitness, offering premium-quality fitness machines & Indoor Gym Equipments like Single Twister, Roman Chair, Slimmer, Walker, Incline Bench & more with innovative technology for indoor & outdoor playground equipments to meet modern fitness standards at competitive prices.'),
(76, 3, 'INDIVIDUALS', 'individuals', 'active', 'Sarwadnya Sports & Fitness, is a Trusted Customized Play Systems For Kids Manufacturers In India offer a wide range of high-quality indoor and outdoor play systems built with a strong focus on safety, durability and innovative design to provide fun, fitness, and long-lasting performance for children of all age groups. Contact us today!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
(77, 3, 'FRP Animal Statue Manufacturer', 'frp-animal-statue-manufacturer', 'active', 'Premium FRP Animal Statues Manufacturers In India for outdoor décor, including Lion, Tiger, and Dinosaur designs. Durable, weather-resistant, and high-quality fiber sculptures ideal for parks, gardens, resorts, and commercial spaces. Available with customization at the best prices—contact us for details.'),
(78, 3, 'Nursery School Desk Bench Manufacturer', 'nursery-school-desk-bench-manufacturer', 'active', 'Nursery School Desk Bench Manufacturers In India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness. Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In India. We offer safe, durable nursery benches, half circular benches, play school benches & chairs. Ideal for schools & institutions. Contact for bulk orders at best prices.'),
(79, 3, 'Indoor Play Equipment Manufacturers', 'indoor-play-equipment-manufacturers', 'active', 'Sarwadnya Sports & Fitness, Nagpur offers premium indoor play equipment for schools & daycares. Explore FRP Rainbow Links, Tots, Hippo, Giraffe, Elephant, Ladder Slides, Pull Carts & more. Durable, safe & fun play solutions across India.');
