(105, 'sarwadnya-special-group-table-bench', 'SARWADNYA SPECIAL GROUP TABLE BENCH', '', '', NULL, '<p data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"777\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"777\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Sarwadnya Special Group Table Bench&nbsp;Manufacturers In Nagpur, India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"777\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"777\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In Nagpur, India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1373\" data-start=\"915\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">We are recognized as a reputed manufacturer and supplier of an exclusive range of&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Sarwadnya Special Group Table Bench</strong>. The offered Cast Iron Garden Bench is designed using the best quality raw material and cutting-edge technology under the guidance of adept professionals. Keeping in mind the different preferences of customers, we offer this bench in varied sizes, designs, and color combinations that enhance the aesthetic appeal of parks, gardens, schools, and public areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1375\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Our&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Sarwadnya Special Group Table&nbsp;Benc