(218, 'frp-reindeer', 'FRP REINDEER', '', '', NULL, '<p data-end=\"239\" data-start=\"155\"><strong data-end=\"237\" data-start=\"155\">FRP Reindeer Statue Manufacturer in Nagpur, India &ndash; Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"665\" data-start=\"241\">Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness, Nagpur, is a leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality <strong data-end=\"367\" data-start=\"343\">FRP Reindeer Statues</strong> in India. Crafted using advanced machinery and premium raw materials, our FRP Reindeer statues are perfect for <strong data-end=\"535\" data-start=\"479\">gardens, schools, parks, and indoor or outdoor decor</strong>. Known for their <strong data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"553\">durability, elegant design, and superior finish</strong>, these statues add a unique aesthetic appeal to any space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"686\" data-start=\"667\"><strong data-end=\"684\" data-start=\"667\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"687\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"711\" data-section-id=\"12kgx12\" data-start=\"687\"><strong data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"689\">Height:</strong> 2.5 feet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"734\" data-section-id=\"1oks64p\" data-start=\"712\"><strong data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"714\">Length:</strong> 5 feet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"758\" data-section-id=\"uykvob\" data-start=\"735\"><strong data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"737\">Shape:</strong> Reindeer</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"819\" data-section-id=\"1bmq025\" data-start=\"759\"><strong data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"761\">Material:</strong> 4-6mm thick FRP (Fiber Reinforced Plastic)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"853\" data-section-id=\"13pfgcg\" data-start=\"820\"><strong data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"822\">Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> 1</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"855\">Available at <strong data-end=\"895\" data-start=\"868\">industry-leading prices</strong>, our FRP Reindeer Statues are highly demanded for t