(221, 'frp-big-bird', 'FRP BIG BIRD', '', '', NULL, '<p data-end=\"150\" data-start=\"68\"><strong data-end=\"150\" data-start=\"68\">FRP Big Bird Statue Manufacturer in Nagpur, India | Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"460\" data-start=\"152\">Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness Nagpur is a trusted manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality <strong data-end=\"293\" data-start=\"252\">FRP Big Bird Statues in Nagpur, India</strong>. We specialize in designing durable and attractive indoor and outdoor decorative structures, including lifelike bird statues crafted using premium-grade FRP material.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"462\">Our FRP Big Bird (Heron/Bagla) statue is manufactured using advanced machinery and superior raw materials, ensuring long-lasting performance, weather resistance, and an elegant finish. These statues are ideal for enhancing the beauty of gardens, schools, parks, resorts, and commercial landscapes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"995\" data-start=\"761\">Known for their eye-catching design and excellent quality, our FRP statues are highly demanded across India. We offer cost-effective pricing without compromising on quality, making us a preferred choice for bulk and individual buyers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"997\"><strong data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"997\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"1015\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1033\" data-section-id=\"1jn9nik\" data-start=\"1015\">Height: 3 Feet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1054\" data-section-id=\"1ty9oic\" data-start=\"1034\">Length: 3.5 Feet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1079\" data-section-id=\"z8ym3v\" data-start=\"1055\">Shape: Heron (Bagla)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1110\" data-section-id=\"19dfzrn\" data-start=\"1080\">Material: High-Quality FRP</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1132\" data-section-id=\"13qyyet\" data-start=\"1111\">Thickness: 4&ndash;6 mm</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1167\" data-section-id=\"a3zsw6\" data-