(239, 'frp-toilet', 'FRP TOILET', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e2a45ccc-8ae5-4c9e-93da-f9ba400ae4ce\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1117\" data-start=\"816\"><strong>FRP Toilet Manufacturers In Nagpur India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1117\" data-start=\"816\"><strong>Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In Nagpur India</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1117\" data-start=\"816\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness is a trusted name among FRP toilet manufacturers in Nagpur, India, offering premium quality Fiber Mobile Toilets at the best price in India. We specialize in manufacturing, supplying, and exporting durable and hygienic portable toilet solutions designed for long-term use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1518\" data-start=\"1119\">Our FRP Toilets are manufactured using superior-grade materials and advanced technology under expert supervision. Each unit undergoes strict quality checks to ensure durability, strength, and safe delivery to the client&rsquo;s location. Known for their precise design, seamless finish, and weather resistance, these toilets are ideal for hospitals, clinics, construction sites, events, and public places.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1520\">We also provide customization options as per customer requirements, ensuring the product perfectly fits your application needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1652\" data-start=\"1649\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"1674\" data-section-id=\"18htyq