(290, '4-seater-paddle-boat', '4-SEATER PADDLE BOAT', '', '', NULL, '<p data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"76\"><strong data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"76\">FRP 4 Seater Paddle Boat Manufacturer in Nagpur, India &ndash; Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"491\" data-start=\"167\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur is a leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality <strong data-end=\"298\" data-start=\"269\">FRP 4 Seater Paddle Boats</strong> in Nagpur, India. We specialize in delivering durable, attractive, and performance-oriented paddle boats suitable for water parks, resorts, lakes, amusement parks, and recreational activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"493\">Our 4 seater FRP paddle boats are manufactured using premium quality raw materials and advanced technology under the supervision of skilled professionals. Designed for safety, stability, and long-lasting performance, these boats are available in various sizes, shapes, and colors as per customer requirements at competitive prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"826\">The offered paddle boats are widely appreciated for their robust construction, corrosion resistance, smooth finishing, and low maintenance, making them an ideal choice for commercial and leisure use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1044\" data-start=\"1027\">Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness for reliable and high-performance FRP paddle boats in India. Contact us today for the best deals and customized solutions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✔ High-quality FRP material ensuring durability and strength</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Weatherproof, termite-resistant, and corrosion-free cabins</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Customizable designs as per client requirements</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Affordable pricing with best-in-class quality</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Timely delivery and professional installation support</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Strict quality testing for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Suitable for industrial, commercial, and residential use</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Trusted manufacturer and supplier in Nagpur</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, '', '', ' 1,06,880/', '', 13, 1, 'SP-63'),
