y FRP (Fiber Reinforced Plastic)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1147\" data-section-id=\"kfha7u\" data-start=\"1108\"><strong data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1110\">Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> 1 Piece</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1325\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1149\">Enhance your outdoor and indoor spaces with our premium FRP Crane Bird Statues. <strong data-end=\"1325\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"1229\">Contact Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness Nagpur today for the best deals and customized solutions.</strong></p>\r\n', NULL, '', '', ' 14,500', '', 31, 1, 'SP-22'),
