(363, 'puppy-bin', 'PUPPY BIN', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"170\" data-start=\"88\"><strong data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"88\">FRP Puppy Dustbin Manufacturer in Nagpur, India | Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"649\" data-start=\"172\">Sarwadnya Sports and Fitness, Nagpur, is a leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality indoor and outdoor gym equipment and FRP products in India. We proudly present our <strong data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"359\">premium FRP Puppy Dustbins</strong>, designed for durability, functionality, and aesthetic appeal. Crafted using <strong data-end=\"515\" data-start=\"467\">premium-grade Fibre Reinforced Plastic (FRP)</strong> and advanced manufacturing techniques, these dustbins adhere to strict industry standards to ensure superior quality and longevity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"898\" data-start=\"651\">Our <strong data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"655\">frp Puppy Dustbins</strong> are available in <strong data-end=\"723\" data-start=\"695\">various sizes and shapes</strong>, allowing clients to choose according to their specific business or home needs. Each dustbin is tested on set quality parameters to deliver the best range to our customers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"900\"><strong data-end=\"917\" data-start=\"900\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1084\" data-start=\"920\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"944\" data-section-id=\"130sv6f\" data-start=\"920\"><strong data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"922\">Height:</strong> 3.5 feet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"975\" data-section-id=\"m6ch1\" data-start=\"945\"><strong data-end=\"960\" data-start=\"947\">Capacity:</strong> 30&ndash;35 litres</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1024\" data-section-id=\"1vk199b\" data-start=\"976\"><strong data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"978\">Material:</strong> FRP (Fibre Reinforced Plastic)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1050\" data-section-id=\"5uks7q\" data-start=\"1025\"><strong data-end=\"1041\" data-start=\"1027\">Thickness:</strong> 4&ndash;5 mm</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1084\" data-section-id=\"13pfgcg\" data-start=\"1051\"><strong data-end=\"1080\" data-start=\"1053\">Minimum Order Quantity:</strong> 1</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1261\" data-start=\"1086\">Ideal for commercial, residential, or outdoor settings, Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness ensures that every frp Puppy Dustbin combines <strong data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1215\">strength, durability, and modern design</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1359\" data-start=\"1263\"><strong data-end=\"1357\" data-start=\"1263\">Order your frp Puppy Dustbin in Nagpur today and experience unmatched quality and service!</strong></p>\r\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '5,200', '', 21, 1, 'SP-15'),
