(489, 'leg-curl-lying', 'Leg Curl Lying', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"987\" data-section-id=\"hn7uwt\" data-start=\"842\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"987\" data-start=\"845\">Leg Curl Lying Machine Manufacturers In Nagpur, India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"987\" data-section-id=\"hn7uwt\" data-start=\"842\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"987\" data-start=\"845\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In India.</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1282\" data-start=\"989\">Enhance your lower body strength with our premium <strong>Leg Curl Lying Machine</strong>, specially engineered for effective hamstring and glute workouts. Built with heavy-duty materials and advanced ergonomic design, this machine ensures maximum comfort, safety, and performance during every workout session.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1607\" data-start=\"1284\">Our <strong>Leg Curl Lying Machine</strong> features adjustable resistance levels, smooth motion mechanics, and cushioned support to provide a comfortable and efficient exercise experience. It is suitable for commercial gyms, fitness centers, and home gym setups, helping users of all fitness levels achieve their strength and toning goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1916\" data-start=\"1609\">Designed for durability and long-term use, this machine supports proper posture and controlled movements, reducing the risk of injury while maximizing muscle engagement. Upgrade your fitness facility with reliable gym equipment from Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness and take your leg training to the next level.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1921\" data-start=\"1918\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"1942\" data-section-id=\"cycl23\" data-start=\"1923\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"1940\" data-start=\"1927\">Key Uses:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2141\" data-start=\"1943\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1976\" data-section-id=\"nwost2\" data-start=\"1943\">Strengthens hamstring muscles</li>\r\n	<li