(493, 'glute-machine', 'Glute Machine', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"792\"><strong data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"792\">Glute Machine&nbsp;Manufacturers In Nagpur, India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"792\"><strong data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"792\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In Nagpur, India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"933\">Enhance your lower body strength and achieve superior fitness performance with our premium quality&nbsp;<strong>Glute machines</strong>. Designed for both beginners and professional athletes, our indoor gym equipment effectively targets inner and outer thigh muscles, helping improve muscle tone, flexibility, and overall stability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1569\" data-start=\"1261\">Our machines are engineered with adjustable resistance levels, ergonomic seating, and durable construction to ensure maximum comfort, safety, and long-lasting performance. Whether for commercial gyms, fitness studios, or home workouts, our <strong>Glute Machines</strong> deliver consistent and efficient results.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1754\" data-start=\"1571\">With a focus on innovation and quality, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness ensures every machine meets industry standards, making your workout experience smooth, safe, and highly effective.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1759\" data-start=\"1756\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"1803\" data-section-id=\"1lkhyfk\" data-start=\"1761\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"1803\" data-start=\"1764\">Uses of Glute Machine :</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2064\" data-start=\"1805\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1872\" data-section-id=\"ze3ybb\" data-start=\"1805\">Strengthens inner (adductor) and outer (abductor) thigh muscles</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1915\" data-section-id=\"icy8w3\" data-start=\"1873\">Improves hip stability and flexibility</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1961\" data-section-id=\"3nixgu\" data-start=\"1916\">Enhances athletic performance and balance</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2011\" data-section-id=\"def3ar\" data-start=\"1962\">Supports injury prevention and rehabilitation</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2064\" data-section-id=\"13meety\" data-start=\"2012\">Ideal for weight loss and muscle toning workouts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"2069\" data-start=\"2066\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"2117\" data-section-id=\"1cb97yw\" data-start=\"2071\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"2117\" data-start=\"2074\">Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2427\" data-start=\"2119\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"2172\" data-section-id=\"3fe322\" data-start=\"2119\">High-quality, durable gym equipment manufacturing</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2219\" data-section-id=\"1vgpb2u\" data-start=\"2173\">Ergonomic and user-friendly machine design</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2267\" data-section-id=\"1wtthz1\" data-start=\"2220\">Suitable for commercial and home gym setups</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2313\" data-section-id=\"1cfic9s\" data-start=\"2268\">Competitive pricing with reliable service</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2371\" data-section-id=\"1lvfd9m\" data-start=\"2314\">Trusted Manufacturer, Supplier, and Exporter in India</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2427\" data-section-id=\"yxshpl\" data-start=\"2372\">Customization options available as per client needs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '47,000 ', '', 29, 1, 'SG-94'),
(494, 'abdominal-with-lower-back-machine', 'Abdominal With Lower Back Machine', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"935\"><strong data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"935\">Abdominal With Lower Back Machine Manufacturers In Nagpur, India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"935\"><strong data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"935\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In Nagpur, India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1090\">Looking to improve your core strength and lower back stability? Our <strong>abdominal with lower back machines</strong> are specially designed to deliver effective and safe workouts for both beginners and professional fitness enthusiasts. Built with high-quality materials and ergonomic design, these machines ensure maximum comfort, durability, and performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1751\" data-start=\"1437\">With adjustable resistance levels and user-friendly features, you can perform a wide range of <strong>abdominal with lower back</strong> exercises to strengthen muscles, improve posture, and enhance overall fitness. Ideal for gyms, fitness centers, and home workout spaces, our machines help you achieve visible results efficiently.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1756\" data-start=\"1753\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1810\" data-section-id=\"1lt2js5\" data-start=\"1758\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"1808\" data-start=\"1762\">Uses of Abdominal With Lower Back Machine:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2029\" data-start=\"1811\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1859\" data-section-id=\"ibu6y3\" data-start=\"1811\">Strengthens abdominal and lower back muscles</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1899\" data-section-id=\"1t794by\" data-start=\"1860\">Improves core stability and posture</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1938\" data-section-id=\"1dbq2da\" data-start=\"1900\">Helps reduce risk of back injuries</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1983\" data-section-id=\"piqgao\" data-start=\"1939\">Supports full-bo