(511, 'lat-pulley-b', 'Lat Pulley (B)', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"774\"><strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Lat Pulley (B)</strong><strong data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"774\">&nbsp;Manufacturers In Nagpur, India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"774\"><strong data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"774\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In Nagpur, India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1321\" data-start=\"911\">Achieve stronger and well-defined abs with our premium quality&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Lat Pulley (B)</strong>, specially designed for effective core strengthening exercises. Built with a robust and durable frame, this bench ensures maximum stability and safety during workouts. Its adjustable height and ergonomic design allow users to perform a variety of exercises like sit-ups, crunches, and abdominal workouts with precision and comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1323\">The bench is crafted using high-grade materials, offering long-lasting performance and resistance to wear and tear. Whether you are setting up a commercial gym or a home fitness space, this sit-up bench is an ideal choice for beginners as well as professional fitness enthusiasts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1898\" data-start=\"1607\">Designed for comfort, efficiency, and durability, our&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Lat Pulley (B)</strong>&nbsp;helps enhance your workout routine and delivers excellent results for core toning and strength building. Invest in quality fitness equipment and take your fitness journey to the next level with Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1903\" data-start=\"1900\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"1936\" data-section-id=\"1u4apap\" data-start=\"1905\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Uses of Lat Pulley (B) :</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2191\" data-start=\"1937\">\