(1047, 'small-elephant', 'SMALL ELEPHANT', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"166\" data-start=\"77\"><strong data-end=\"166\" data-start=\"77\">Frp Small Elephant Dustbin Manufacturer in India | Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"168\">Sarwadnya Sports &amp; Fitness India, is a leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"316\" data-start=\"268\">FRP Small Elephant Dustbins in Nagpur, India</strong>&nbsp;at the best price. We specialize in durable and attractive indoor &amp; outdoor waste management solutions along with gym equipment manufacturing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"776\" data-start=\"461\">Our&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"489\" data-start=\"465\">Frp Elephant Dustbin</strong>&nbsp;is designed using premium-grade Fibre Reinforced Plastic (FRP) sourced from trusted vendors, ensuring long-lasting performance, strength, and weather resistance. The unique elephant design makes it ideal for parks, schools, gardens, playgrounds, residential complexes, and public areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"944\" data-start=\"778\">With a strong commitment to quality and customer satisfaction, our products are widely appreciated for their durability, lightweight structure, and easy installation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"946\"><strong data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"946\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1219\" data-start=\"964\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"984\" data-section-id=\"93vexi\" data-start=\"964\">Height: 2.5 Feet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1011\" data-section-id=\"6l9r7o\" data-start=\"985\">Capacity: 25&ndash;30 Litres</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1056\" data-section-id=\"7kobz3\" data-start=\"1012\">Material: FRP (Fibre Reinforced Plastic)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1078\" data-section-id=\"15njiza\" data-start=\"1057\">Thickness: 4&ndash;5 mm</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1135\" data-section-id=\"11d9958\" data-start=\"1079\">Features: Ready to use, lightweight, easy to install</li