(1175, 'frp-nirmalya-kalash', 'FRP NIRMALYA KALASH', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"861\" data-section-id=\"1gmbwe\" data-start=\"719\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"722\">FRP Nirmalya Kalash Manufacturers In India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"861\" data-section-id=\"1gmbwe\" data-start=\"719\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"722\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In India.</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1197\" data-start=\"863\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness, Nagpur is a trusted name in manufacturing premium quality&nbsp;<strong>FRP Nirmalya Kalash</strong>&nbsp;designed for safe and eco-friendly collection of religious waste (Nirmalya). Our kalash is specially developed for temples, ghats, riversides, and public places to maintain cleanliness and support environmental sustainability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1470\" data-start=\"1199\">Made from high-grade Fiber Reinforced Plastic (FRP), this&nbsp;<strong>Nirmalya Kalash</strong>&nbsp;offers excellent durability, weather resistance, and long service life even in outdoor conditions. Its robust structure ensures resistance against corrosion, water, and harsh environmental factors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1507\" data-section-id=\"1vl6t3u\" data-start=\"1477\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"1683\" data-start=\"1651\">Uses of FRP Nirmalya Kalash:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1948\" data-start=\"1684\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1754\" data-section-id=\"1mnirfm\" data-start=\"1684\">Collection of religious waste (flowers, garlands, pooja materials)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1803\" data-section-id=\"erkaw3\" data-start=\"1755\">Installation at temples and pilgrimage sites</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1843\" data-section-id=\"xcky3n\" data-start=\"1804\">Use at riverbanks, ghats, and lakes</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1893\" data-section-id=\"5axz1z\" data-start=\"1844\">Maintaining hygiene in public religious area