(1219, 'wheel-barrow', 'WHEEL BARROW', '', '', '', '<p><span xss=\"removed\">By keeping track of the latest market development, we are engaged in offering an exclusive range of </span><b xss=\"removed\">2 wheeled Wheelbarrow</b><span xss=\"removed\">. We offer this borrow in different specifications and sizes so as to meet the demands of our valuable clients. The provided borrow is manufactured using premium quality raw material and cutting edge technology in line with industry standards. Moreover, this borrow is tested on predefined parameters of quality so as to offer qualitative product at the clients&#39; end.</span></p>\n', '', '', '', ' 9,185/-', '', 60, 3, 'PF-61'),
(1220, 'tricycle-rickshaw', 'TRICYCLE RICKSHAW', '', '', '', '<p><span xss=removed>With an aim to fulfill varied requirements of our valued clients, we are engaged in offering </span><b xss=removed>Tricycle Rickshaw Garbage Container</b><span xss=removed>. At our unit, our professionals manufacture the garbage container by adhering to industry norms. They also make sure to use quality materials and approved components for manufacturing the van. Once the van is ready for operation, our engineers ensure by opting strict quality checks so that the van offers reliability and high performance to the clients. Furthermore, clients can opt for custom design and compact design according to business requirements.</span></p>\n', '', '', '', ' 36,575/', '', 60, 3, 'PF-62             '),
(1221, 'litter-bins', 'LITTER BINS', '', '', '', '<p><span xss=removed>With the assistance of our deft team of professionals, we are able to introduce a broad array of </span><strong>LITTER BINS</strong><span xss=removed>. The offered dustbin is developed in accordance to industry norms and quality parameters. In the offered dustbin, our professionals use the approved material during the manufacturing process. In addition, this dustbin can be built and developed according to the specification provided by the clients. Furthermore, our professionals opt for strict quality inspection made on the dustbin to ensure high performance.</span></p>\n', '', '', '', ' 8,185/-', '', 60, 3, 'PF-63     '),
(1222, 'container-1', 'CONTAINER-1', '', '', '', '<p><span xss=removed>We feel proud to introduce ourselves as the leading organization in this domain, engaged in presenting an excellent grade of </span><b xss=removed>Waste Container</b><span xss=removed>. This container is equipped with holder, and wheels. The offered container is manufactured using quality plastic materials and latest techniques. This container can be installed in lawn, garden, and even in the water parks. Weight, height, and color has been perfectly chosen and designed by our professionals. Besides, clients can get the container from us at cost effective prices.</span></p>\n', '', '', '', ' 51,770/-', '', 60, 3, ' PF-64     '),
