(1226, 'hdpe-wheeled-dustbin', 'HDPE WHEELED DUSTBIN', '', '', '', '<p><span xss=\"removed\">To satisfy the rising requirements of industry, we are engaged in manufacturing and supplying a wide gamut of </span><strong>HDPE WHEELED DUSTBIN</strong><span xss=\"removed\">. These Dustbin Trolley are manufactured by our adept professionals using the best quality raw material and progressive technology. Our offered dustbins are widely used in playgrounds, schools, parks and gardens. The provided Dustbin Trolley are highly demanded owing to its sturdiness and quality.</span></p>\n', '', '', '', ' 48,430/', '', 60, 3, 'PF-68'),
