(1228, '4-seater-paddle-boat', '4-SEATER PADDLE BOAT', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"76\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"76\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">FRP 4 Seater Paddle Boat Manufacturer in India &ndash; Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"491\" data-start=\"167\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur is a leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"298\" data-start=\"269\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">FRP 4 Seater Paddle Boats</strong>&nbsp;in Nagpur, India. We specialize in delivering durable, attractive, and performance-oriented paddle boats suitable for water parks, resorts, lakes, amusement parks, and recreational activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"493\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Our 4 seater FRP paddle boats are manufactured using premium quality raw materials and advanced technology under the supervision of skilled professionals. Designed for safety, stability, and long-lasting performance, these boats are available in various sizes, shapes, and colors as per customer requirements at competitive prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"826\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">The offered paddle boats are widely appreciated for their robust construction, corrosion resistance, smooth finishing, and low maintenance, making them an ideal choice for commercial and leisure use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1044\" data-start=\"1027\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness for reliable and high-performance FRP paddle boats in India. Contact us today for the best deals and customized solutions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✔ High-quality FRP material ensuring durability and strength</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Weatherproof, termite-resistant, and corrosion-free cabins</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Customizable designs as per client requirements</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Affordable pricing with best-in-class quality</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Timely delivery and professional installation support</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Strict quality testing for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Suitable for industrial, commercial, and residential use</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Trusted manufacturer and supplier in Nagpur</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '', '', '', ' 1,06,880/', '', 59, 3, 'SP-63'),
(1229, '2-seater-swan-boat', '2-SEATER SWAN BOAT', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"0\">Frp 2 Seater Swan Boat Manufacturer In Nagpur India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur, Leading Indoor &amp; Outdoor Gym &amp; Playground Equipments Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In Nagpur India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"203\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur is a trusted name in manufacturing and supplying premium quality&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"331\" data-start=\"304\">FRP 2 Seater Swan Boats</strong>&nbsp;in Nagpur, India. Designed with precision and crafted using high-grade fiber reinforced plastic, our swan boats are perfect for lakes, resorts, amusement parks, water parks, and recreational activities. We focus on durability, safety, and aesthetic appeal to deliver a product that stands out in performance and design.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"653\">Our experienced professionals use top-quality raw materials and advanced manufacturing techniques to ensure long-lasting strength, weather resistance, and smooth finishing. These boats are available in customized sizes, colors, and designs to meet specific client requirements. With a focus on affordability and quality, we offer our products at competitive and budget-friendly prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1040\">The FRP 2 Seater Swan Boat is widely appreciated for its attractive design, sturdy construction, corrosion resistance, low maintenance, and excellent water stability. Whether for commercial use or leisure activities, our swan boats provide a safe and enjoyable riding experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1338\" data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"1321\">Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur for reliable, durable, and visually appealing FRP Swan Boats that enhance your water attraction setup.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✔ High-quality FRP material ensuring durability and strength</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Weatherproof, termite-resistant, and corrosion-free cabins</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Customizable designs as per client requirements</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Affordable pricing with best-in-class quality</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Timely delivery and professional installation support</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Strict quality testing for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Suitable for industrial, commercial, and residential use</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Trusted manufacturer and supplier in Nagpur</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '', '', '', '  98,530/', '', 59, 3, ' PF-72                           '),
(1230, 'frp-champu-boat', 'FRP CHAMPU BOAT', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"87\" data-start=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-end=\"87\" data-start=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Frp Champu Boat Manufacturer In Nagpur India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"414\" data-start=\"89\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur is a leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"191\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">FRP Champu Boat (Row Boat/Chappu Boat)</strong>&nbsp;in Nagpur, India. Designed using premium materials and advanced technology, our boats ensure durability, strength, and long-lasting performance for lakes, water parks, and resorts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"707\" data-start=\"416\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">The boat features 12 ft length, 5 ft width, and seating capacity of 4&ndash;6 persons. Made with 5 mm thick FRP using 4-layer mesh and WR ISO water-grade resin, it offers excellent water resistance and stability. Available in Blue, Red, Green, and Yellow colors with smooth rowing (chappu) system.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"807\" data-start=\"709\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-end=\"726\" data-start=\"709\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Key Features:</strong>&nbsp;Durable, low maintenance, strong build, attractive design, customizable options.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"888\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"809\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-end=\"836\" data-start=\"809\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Minimum Order Quantity:</strong>&nbsp;1 Unit<br data-end=\"846\" data-start=\"843\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" />\r\nContact us for best price and bulk orders.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; list-style-position: outside; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; color: rgb(111, 111, 111); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ High-quality FRP material ensuring durability and strength</li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ Weatherproof, termite-resistant, and corrosion-free cabins</li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ Customizable designs as per client requirements</li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ Affordable pricing with best-in-class quality</li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ Timely delivery and professional installation support</li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ Strict quality testing for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ Suitable for industrial, commercial, and residential use</li>\r\n	<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\">✔ Trusted manufacturer