(1232, 'frp-car-model-boat', 'FRP CAR MODEL BOAT', '', '', '', '<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-2\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"request-69b98b05-1e30-8321-9b3c-e9fb414d53d7-21\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"0baed149-688a-4b23-bf5b-5e8ac2cdfdbc\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-end=\"197\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"197\" data-start=\"0\">Frp Car Model Boat Manufacturer In Nagpur India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur, Leading Indoor &amp; Outdoor Gym &amp; Playground Equipments Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In Nagpur India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"199\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur is a trusted name in manufacturing and supplying premium quality <strong data-end=\"323\" data-start=\"300\">FRP Car Model Boats</strong> designed for durability, safety, and visual appeal. Our FRP boats are widely used in water parks, resorts, amusement parks, lakes, and recreational activities. With a focus on innovation and quality, we ensure that every product meets industry standards and customer expectations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"606\">To keep the client satisfied, we manufacture and supply high quality FRP Car Model Boat. Our adroit professionals utilize quality tested raw material and progressive technology while manufacturing this boat. Moreover, this boat can be availed in different sizes and shapes at pocket friendly prices. The provided boat is highly appreciated in the market owing to its excellent finish, high strength, corrosion resistance, and long service life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1278\" data-start=\"1052\">We offer complete solutions including <strong data-end=\"1142\" data-start=\"1090\">design, manufacturing, supply, and customization</strong> as per client requirements. Our FRP boats are easy to maintain, lightweight, and ideal for long-term use in various water environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1297\" data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"1280\">For the best quality <strong data-end=\"1570\" data-start=\"1525\">FRP Car Model Boat Manufacturer in Nagpur</strong>, choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur for reliable products at competitive prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✔ High-quality FRP material ensuring durability and strength</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Weatherproof, termite-resistant, and corrosion-free cabins</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Customizable designs as per client requirements</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Affordable pricing with best-in-class quality</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Timely delivery and professional installation support</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Strict quality testing for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Suitable for industrial, commercial, and residential use</li>\r\n	<li>✔ Trusted manufacturer and supplier in Nagpur</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-3\" data-turn=\"user\" data-turn-id=\"b443e06e-dcb5-40db-b000-3e89f5b2da08\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-author-role=\"user\" data-message-id=\"b443e06e-dcb5-40db-b000-3e89f5b2da08\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start\">\r\n<div class=\"user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%)\">\r\n<div class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n', '', '', '', ' 1,18,570/', '', 59, 3, 'SP-67'),
(1233, 'multi-seater-motor-boat-10-seater-without-engine', 'MULTI SEATER MOTOR BOAT (10 SEATER) WITHOUT ENGINE', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"120\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"120\" data-start=\"0\">Multi Seater Motor Boat 10 Seater Without Engine Manufacturer In India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"122\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur is a trusted name in manufacturing high-quality Multi Seater Motor Boats designed for durability, performance, and safety. As a leading indoor &amp; outdoor gym and playground equipment manufacturer, supplier, and exporter in Nagpur, India, we also specialize in premium water sports equipment to meet diverse client requirements across resorts, water parks, lakes, and recreational facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1002\" data-start=\"550\">Our 10-seater motor boat (without engine) is crafted using superior-grade raw materials and advanced manufacturing technology, ensuring long-lasting strength and reliability. Designed as per industry standards, this multi-seater boat offers excellent stability and comfort, making it ideal for group rides and leisure activities. Each boat undergoes strict quality testing on various parameters to ensure flawless performance and customer satisfaction.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1004\">With an elegant, classy design and robust structure, our motor boat is widely appreciated for its smooth finish, corrosion resistance, and low maintenance. Whether for commercial or recreational use, this boat delivers both functionality and aesthetic appeal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1282\" data-start=\"1265\"><strong data-end=\"1282\" data-start=\"1265\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1460\" data-start=\"1283\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1303\" data-section-id=\"1as29pg\" data-start=\"1283\">Length: 18&ndash;20 ft</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1329\" data-section-id=\"qhzpgo\" data-start=\"1304\">Breadth: 1.6 to 2.5 m</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1354\" data-section-id=\"ywo46r\" data-start=\"1330\">Depth: 0.65 to 0.9 m</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1379\" data-section-id=\"1h2chj5\" data-start=\"1355\">Capacity: 10 Persons</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1425\" data-section-id=\"pd4p8r\" data-start=\"1380\">Weight: 250 kg to 600 kg (Without Engine)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1460\" data-section-id=\"a3zsw6\" data-start=\"1426\">Minimum Order Quantity: 1 Unit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1629\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1462\">Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur for reliable, high-performance water boats at competitive prices. Contact us today for customized solutions and bulk orders.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', ' 3,50,700 /-', '', 59, 3, 'SP-68'),
