 Sports and Fitness Nagpur for premium-quality FRP statues that combine strength, beauty, and affordability.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', ' 1,49,000', '', 77, 3, 'SP-25'),
(1288, 'frp-giraffe', 'FRP Giraffe', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"155\" data-start=\"72\"><strong data-end=\"155\" data-start=\"72\">FRP Giraffe Statue Manufacturer in&nbsp;India | Sarwadnya Sports and Fitness</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"157\">Sarwadnya Sports and Fitness, Nagpur is a trusted and leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of premium-quality FRP Giraffe Statues in India. We specialize in designing and manufacturing high-quality indoor and outdoor gym equipment, playground equipment, and decorative sculptures that enhance the beauty of any space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"484\">Our FRP Giraffe Statue is manufactured using advanced machinery and superior-grade raw materials to ensure durability, weather resistance, and long-lasting performance. This beautifully crafted statue features an elegant design and fine finishing, making it an ideal choice for gardens, schools, amusement parks, resorts, public spaces, and commercial areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1101\" data-start=\"844\">With its eye-catching appearance and sturdy construction, the FRP Giraffe Statue is highly demanded across the industry. We also offer customization options in colors as per the buyer&rsquo;s requirements, ensuring it perfectly matches your theme and environment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1266\" data-start=\"1103\">We are committed to delivering top-quality products at competitive and industry-leading prices, making us a preferred choice for clients across India and globally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1285\" data-start=\"1268\"><strong data-end=\"1285\" data-start=\"1268\">Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1539\" data-start=\"1286\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1307\" data-section-id=\"66wwx0\" data-start=\"1286\">Size: 11 x 9 Feet</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1365\" data-section-id=\"1ntlkpd\" data-start=\"1308\">Material: High-Quality FRP (Fiber Reinforced Plastic)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"1411\" data-section-id=\"1aif2x4\" data-star