(1375, 'roman-chair-with-hyper-extension', 'Roman Chair With Hyper Extension', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"977\"><strong data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"977\">Roman Chair With Hyper Extension Manufacturers In India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"977\"><strong data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"977\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1456\" data-start=\"1131\">With extensive industry experience, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness is a leading manufacturer and supplier of high-quality&nbsp;<strong>Roman Chair with Hyper Extension equipment</strong>. This equipment is specially designed to strengthen the lower back, core muscles, glutes, and hamstrings, making it an essential addition to any modern gym setup.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1757\" data-start=\"1458\">Our&nbsp;<strong>Roman Chair with hyper extension</strong>&nbsp;is manufactured using premium-grade raw materials and advanced technology under the supervision of skilled professionals. It features a sturdy structure, ergonomic design, adjustable settings, and a comfortable padding system to ensure maximum safety and performance during workouts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"2084\" data-start=\"1759\">We offer this gym equipment in various sizes, designs, and finishes to meet the diverse requirements of gyms, fitness centers, sports clubs, and home users. Our products are widely appreciated for their durability, smooth finish, and long-lasting performance. We also provide customization options as per client requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2086\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"2143\" data-section-id=\"1qg3rbc\" data-start=\"2091\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"2141\" data-start=\"2097\">Uses of Roman Chair With Hyper Extension</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2407\" data-start=\"2145\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"2179\" data-section-id=\"6s9dxr\" data-start=\"2145\">Strengthens lower 