(1448, 'preacher-curl-machine-1', 'Preacher Curl Machine-1', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"774\"><strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Preacher Curl</strong><strong data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"774\">&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">&nbsp;Machine -1</strong><strong data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"774\">&nbsp;Manufacturers In India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"774\"><strong data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"774\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1321\" data-start=\"911\">Achieve stronger and well-defined abs with our premium quality&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Preacher Curl</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">&nbsp;Machine -1</strong>, specially designed for effective core strengthening exercises. Built with a robust and durable frame, this bench ensures maximum stability and safety during workouts. Its adjustable height and ergonomic design allow users to perform a variety of exercises like sit-ups, crunches, and abdominal workouts with precision and comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1323\">The bench is crafted using high-grade materials, offering long-lasting performance and resistance to wear and tear. Whether you are setting up a commercial gym or a home fitness space, this sit-up bench is an ideal choice for beginners as well as professional fitness enthusiasts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1898\" data-start=\"1607\">Designed for comfort, efficiency, and durability, our&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Preacher Curl</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">&nbsp;Machine -1</strong>&nbsp;helps enhance your workout routine and delivers excellent results for core toning and strength building. Invest in quality fitness equipment and take your fitness journey to the next level with Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1903\" data-start=\"1900\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"1936\" data-section-id=\"1u4apap\" data-start=\"1905\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1908\">Uses of Preacher Curl Machine -1 :</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2191\" data-start=\"1937\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"1982\" data-section-id=\"7qouth\" data-start=\"1937\">Core strengthening and abdominal workouts</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2031\" data-section-id=\"6r9jr5\" data-start=\"1983\">Performing sit-ups, crunches, and leg raises</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2069\" data-section-id=\"1ds7jgb\" data-start=\"2032\">Improving posture and flexibility</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2127\" data-section-id=\"1ncldma\" data-start=\"2070\">Suitable for home gyms and commercial fitness centers</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2191\" data-section-id=\"usr9sw\" data-start=\"2128\">Full-body workout support with multiple exercise variations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"2196\" data-start=\"2193\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"2247\" data-section-id=\"3oswf6\" data-start=\"2198\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"2245\" data-start=\"2201\">Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2534\" data-start=\"2248\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"2290\" data-section-id=\"buyoe5\" data-start=\"2248\">High-quality and durable gym equipment</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2343\" data-section-id=\"zzfnfa\" data-start=\"2291\">Strong and stable construction for safe workouts</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2383\" data-section-id=\"6lsnct\" data-start=\"2344\">Adjustable and user-friendly design</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2430\" data-section-id=\"10i8ont\" data-start=\"2384\">Ideal for both beginners and professionals</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2476\" data-section-id=\"1cfic9s\" data-start=\"2431\">Competitive pricing with reliable service</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2534\" data-section-id=\"hnt6tm\" data-start=\"2477\">Trusted manufacturer, supplier, and exporter in India</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '', '', '', '80,308 ', '', 75, 3, 'SG-117'),
(1449, 'supporting-pull-ups', 'Supporting Pull-Ups', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"973\"><strong data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"973\">Supporting Pull Ups Manufacturers In India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"973\"><strong data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"973\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In&nbsp;India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1433\" data-start=\"1114\">Enhance your upper body strength with our premium quality <strong>supporting pull-up machines</strong>, specially designed for both beginners and advanced fitness enthusiasts. These machines provide assisted support, allowing users to perform pull-ups with proper form while gradually building strength in the back, shoulders, and arms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1776\" data-start=\"1435\">Our <strong>indoor gym supporting pull-up machines</strong> come with adjustable resistance levels, ensuring a customized workout experience based on individual fitness goals. Built with robust materials and ergonomic design, they offer safety, stability, and long-lasting performance, making them ideal for commercial gyms, fitness centers, and home setups.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1955\" data-start=\"1778\">Whether you are starting your fitness journey or aiming to improve endurance and muscle strength, our assisted pull-up machines are the perfect addition to your workout routine.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1960\" data-start=\"1957\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2005\" data-section-id=\"5tytr6\" data-start=\"1962\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"2005\" data-start=\"1966\">Uses of Supporting Pull-Up Machine:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2297\" data-start=\"2006\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"2052\" data-section-id=\"oucl7c\" data-start=\"2006\">Helps beginners perform pull-ups with ease</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2107\" data-section-id=\"jgfi34\" data-start=\"2053\">Builds upper body strength (back, arms, shoulders)</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2148\" data-section-id=\"h761cy\" data-start=\"2108\">Improves grip strength and endurance</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2191\" data-section-id=\"ye2f86\" data-start=\"2149\">Supports progressive strength training</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2244\" data-section-id=\"lwb6cy\" data-start=\"2192\">Ideal for rehabilitation and controlled workouts</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2297\" data-section-id=\"b3wd8t\" data-start=\"2245\">Suitable for gyms, fitness centers, and home use</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"2302\" data-start=\"2299\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2352\" data-section-id=\"4kra2p\" data-start=\"2304\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"2352\" data-start=\"2308\">Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness:</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2654\" data-start=\"2353\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"2395\" data-section-id=\"buyoe5\" data-start=\"2353\">High-quality and durable gym equipment</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2446\" data-section-id=\"1d293ob\" data-start=\"2396\">Advanced design with adjustable support system</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2504\" data-section-id=\"hnt6tm\" data-start=\"2447\">Trusted manufacturer, supplier, and exporter in India</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2549\" data-section-id=\"1om72em\" data-start=\"2505\">Suitable for commercial and personal use</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2604\" data-section-id=\"1x1hqus\" data-start=\"2550\">Competitive pricing with best-in-class performance</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2654\" data-section-id=\"rfpb2k\" data-start=\"2605\">Reliable customer support and timely delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '', '', '', '99,808 ', '', 75, 3, 'SG-118'),
(1450, 'seated-leg-press-machine', 'Seated Leg Press Machine', '', '', '', '<p data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"861\"><strong data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"861\">Seated Leg Press Machine Manufacturers In India By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"861\"><strong data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"861\">Manufacturer, Supplier and Exporter In India.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1339\" data-start=\"999\">The&nbsp;<strong>Seated Leg Press machine</strong>&nbsp;is an essential piece of indoor gym equipment designed to effectively target the quadriceps, hamstrings, calves, and glute muscles. Built with a strong and durable frame, this machine ensures safety, stability, and long-lasting performance, making it ideal for commercial gyms, fitness centers, and home setups.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1341\">Engineered with ergonomic seating and smooth weight resistance mechanisms, the Seated Leg Press allows users to perform controlled and efficient lower body workouts. Its adjustable settings make it suitable for beginners as well as professional athletes, ensuring proper posture and reduced risk of injury.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"1911\" data-start=\"1649\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness offers premium quality&nbsp;<strong>Seated Leg Press machines</strong>&nbsp;that combine innovation, comfort, and performance. Our equipment is manufactured using high-grade materials and advanced technology to deliver maximum efficiency and user satisfaction.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1916\" data-start=\"1913\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"1957\" data-section-id=\"1gy2b82\" data-start=\"1918\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"1957\" data-start=\"1921\">Uses of Seated Leg Press Machine :</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2238\" data-start=\"1959\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"2030\" data-section-id=\"ofugd9\" data-start=\"1959\">Strengthens lower body muscles including thighs, calves, and glutes</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2082\" data-section-id=\"1092dkk\" data-start=\"2031\">Improves muscle endurance and overall leg power</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2133\" data-section-id=\"c85oh\" data-start=\"2083\">Supports safe and controlled strength training</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2192\" data-section-id=\"x3b2c1\" data-start=\"2134\">Ideal for rehabilitation and injury recovery exercises</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2238\" data-section-id=\"3nixgu\" data-start=\"2193\">Enhances athletic performance and balance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"2243\" data-start=\"2240\" />\r\n<p data-end=\"2292\" data-section-id=\"vmyvxj\" data-start=\"2245\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-end=\"2292\" data-start=\"2248\">Why Choose Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness?</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"2627\" data-start=\"2294\">\r\n	<li data-end=\"2351\" data-section-id=\"hnt6tm\" data-start=\"2294\">Trusted manufacturer, supplier, and exporter in India</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2417\" data-section-id=\"aqyqse\" data-start=\"2352\">High-quality, durable, and precision-engineered gym equipment</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2467\" data-section-id=\"1lqlkun\" data-start=\"2418\">Customization options as per gym requirements</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2512\" data-section-id=\"1ketafj\" data-start=\"2468\">Competitive pricing with assured quality</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2563\" data-section-id=\"12cn6fk\" data-start=\"2513\">Timely delivery and excellent customer support</li>\r\n	<li data-end=\"2627\" data-section-id=\"mkqubu\" data-start=\"2564\">Suitable for commercial gyms, fitness studios, and home use</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '', '', '', '93,136 ', '', 75, 3, 'SG-119'),
(1451, 'solar-water-heater', 'Solar Water Heater', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"252\" data-start=\"136\"><strong data-end=\"270\" data-start=\"254\">Description:</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"104\" xss=removed>Experience sustainable heating with the Solar Water Heater Model by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur, India. This functional educational model demonstrates the advantages of non-conventional and renewable energy resources by showcasing how solar energy efficiently heats water. Ideal for schools, colleges, ITI institutes, training centers, science exhibitions, and renewable energy awareness programs, this eco-friendly solar water heating system promotes green energy, energy conservation, and cost-effective heating solutions. Manufactured using durable materials with a clear working demonstration, this solar water heater model supports environmental education and sustainable development initiatives across India.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1237\" data-start=\"863\" xss=removed> </p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1237\" data-start=\"863\" xss=removed><strong xss=removed>Key Features of Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Solar Water Heater Model :</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1742\" data-start=\"1306\" xss=removed>✅ Demonstrates working principle of solar thermal energy<br data-end=\"1365\" data-start=\"1362\" xss=removed>\n✅ Promotes renewable & non-conventional energy awareness<br data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1421\" xss=removed>\n✅ Durable and long-lasting educational model<br data-end=\"1471\" data-start=\"1468\" xss=removed>\n✅ Ideal for schools, colleges, exhibitions & training institutes<br data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1535\" xss=removed>\n✅ Cost-effective and eco-friendly energy solution<br data-end=\"1590\" data-start=\"1587\" xss=removed>\n✅ Clear visual display for easy understanding<br data-end=\"1638\" data-start=\"1635\" xss=removed>\n✅ Supports environmental & sustainability education<br data-end=\"1692\" data-start=\"1689\" xss=removed>\n✅ Manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness, Nagpur, India</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1742\" data-start=\"1306\" xss=removed><strong data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"863\" xss=removed>Target Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"887\" xss=removed>\nSolar Water Heater Model Manufacturer In Nagpur<br data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"934\" xss=removed>\nEducational Solar Energy Model India<br data-end=\"976\" data-start=\"973\" xss=removed>\nRenewable Energy Demonstration Model<br data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"1012\" xss=removed>\nSolar Water Heating System for Schools<br data-end=\"1056\" data-start=\"1053\" xss=removed>\nNon-Conventional Energy Project Model<br data-end=\"1096\" data-start=\"1093\" xss=removed>\nSustainable Energy Teaching Equipment<br data-end=\"1136\" data-start=\"1133\" xss=removed>\nSolar Thermal Energy Model<br data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1162\" xss=removed>\nEco-Friendly Water Heating System<br data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1198\" xss=removed>\nSarwadnya Sports And Fitness Solar Models India</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '69,500', '', 7, 1, 'PFSP - 77');
