(1471, 'mars-rover-model', 'Mars Rover Model', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h3 data-end=\"236\" data-start=\"207\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"234\" data-start=\"211\" xss=\"removed\">Description :</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"237\" xss=\"removed\">Bring the wonders of space exploration to life with the <strong data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"293\" xss=\"removed\">3-Feet Mars Rover Model manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness India. </strong>Crafted from <strong data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"367\" xss=\"removed\">high-quality fiberglass</strong>, this realistic rover replica is designed for <strong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"441\" xss=\"removed\">STEM education, science museums, planetariums, exhibitions, and themed decor</strong>. Its detailed structure and durable build make it a perfect learning and display tool for all ages.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"623\" xss=\"removed\">\n<h3 data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"628\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"632\" xss=\"removed\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1099\" data-start=\"649\" xss=\"removed\">\n <li data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"649\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"651\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"668\" data-start=\"651\" xss=\"removed\">3 Feet Height</strong> – Ideal size for classrooms, labs, and display setups</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"806\" data-start=\"725\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"806\" data-start=\"727\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"727\" xss=\"removed\">High-Quality Fiberglass Construction</strong> – Strong, lightweight & long-lasting</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"807\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"809\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"809\" xss=\"removed\">Realistic Rover Detailing</strong> – Inspired by actual Mars rover designs</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"881\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p d