(1478, 'saturn-model', 'Saturn Model', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description : </p>\n\n<p data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"125\">The <strong data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"129\">Saturn Model Science Park Equipment</strong> by <strong data-end=\"191\" data-start=\"172\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is a durable and visually engaging learning structure designed for outdoor science parks and educational play areas. With a <strong data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"316\">height of 4.5 ft</strong> and a <strong data-end=\"364\" data-start=\"343\">5 ft round design</strong>, this model helps children understand planetary concepts while enjoying interactive play. Ideal for schools, museums, and public parks, this equipment enhances experiential learning and outdoor STEM activities.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"577\">\n<h3 data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"582\"><strong data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"586\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"603\">\n <li data-end=\"670\" data-start=\"603\">\n <p data-end=\"670\" data-start=\"605\">Sturdy <strong data-end=\"639\" data-start=\"612\">fiberglass construction</strong> for long-lasting outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"671\">\n <p data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"673\"><strong data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"673\">4.5 ft height</strong> and <strong data-end=\"709\" data-start=\"695\">5 ft round</strong> structure for safe, accessible learning</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"752\">\n <p data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"754\">Attractive <strong data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"765\">Saturn model design</strong> for visual engagement</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"813\">\n <p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"815\">Weather-resistant, low-maintenance materials</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"862\">\n <p data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"864\">Designed and <strong data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"877\">manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"917\" data-start=\"914\">\n<h3 data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"919\"><strong data-end=\"931\" data-start=\"923\">Uses</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1200\" data-start=\"932\">\n <li data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"932\">\n <p data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"934\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"944\">science parks</strong> and <strong data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"966\">STEM learning zones</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"992\">\n <p data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"994\">Perfect for <strong data-end=\"1060\" data-start=\"1006\">schools, playgrounds, and educational institutions</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1063\">\n <p data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1065\">Great for <strong data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"1075\">museum exhibits</strong> and outdoor science installations</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1200\" data-start=\"1131\">\n <p data-end=\"1200\" data-start=\"1133\">Encourages <strong data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1144\">interactive learning</strong> and curiosity about astronomy</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"435\"> </p>\n\n<p data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"435\"><strong data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"435\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"456\">\nSaturn model playground equipment, science park equipment, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness, Nagpur, India, educational outdoor equipment, astronomy model for schools, 4.5 ft Saturn model, 5 ft round science equipment, outdoor learning tools.</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"659\"> </h3>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1,19,000', '', 7, 1, 'PFSP-86'),
