(1484, 'sand-pendulum', 'Sand Pendulum', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p xss=\"removed\">Description : </p>\n\n<p data-end=\"414\" data-start=\"0\" xss=\"removed\">Sand Pendulum <strong data-end=\"81\" data-start=\"55\" xss=\"removed\">Science Park Equipment</strong> manufactured by <strong data-end=\"117\" data-start=\"98\" xss=\"removed\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is an interactive outdoor learning tool designed to demonstrate <strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"182\" xss=\"removed\">harmonic motion</strong>, <strong data-end=\"214\" data-start=\"203\" xss=\"removed\">gravity</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"240\" data-start=\"220\" xss=\"removed\">pendulum physics</strong>. Built with durable materials, this equipment creates beautiful geometric sand patterns, making it ideal for <strong data-end=\"413\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"350\" xss=\"removed\">science parks, schools, museums, and public learning spaces</strong>.</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"441\" data-start=\"421\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"441\" data-start=\"425\" xss=\"removed\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"442\" xss=\"removed\">\n <li data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"442\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"444\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"468\" data-start=\"444\" xss=\"removed\">Robust Construction:</strong> Made from high-quality FRP/metal for long outdoor life.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"619\" data-start=\"527\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"619\" data-start=\"529\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"529\" xss=\"removed\">Smooth Pendulum Motion:</strong> Balanced design ensures accurate and consistent oscillation.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"620\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"622\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"622\" xss=\"removed\">Attractive Sand Patterns:</strong> Produces clear geometric shapes for visual learning.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"707\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"709\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"731\" data-start=\"709\" xss=\"removed\">Weather-Resistant:</strong> Suitable for continuous outdoor installation.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"780\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"782\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"815\" data-start=\"782\" xss=\"removed\">Safe & Child-Friendly Design:</strong> Rounded edges and stable structure.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"854\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"856\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"856\" xss=\"removed\">Low Maintenance:</strong> Easy to operate and clean.</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"905\" xss=\"removed\">\n<h3 data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"910\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"914\" xss=\"removed\">Uses / Applications</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"938\" xss=\"removed\">\n <li data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"938\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"940\" xss=\"removed\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"953\" xss=\"removed\">simple harmonic motion</strong> and <strong data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"984\" xss=\"removed\">pendulum physics</strong> concepts.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"1017\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"1019\" xss=\"removed\">Enhances curiosity and practical understanding in <strong data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"1069\" xss=\"removed\">students and visitors</strong>.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1188\" data-start=\"1098\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"1188\" data-start=\"1100\" xss=\"removed\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"1185\" data-start=\"1110\" xss=\"removed\">science parks, educational institutes, amusement parks, and playgrounds</strong>.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1189\" xss=\"