(1490, 'planetary-motion', 'Planetary Motion', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"130\"><strong data-end=\"204\" data-start=\"130\">Description :</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"130\"><strong data-end=\"204\" data-start=\"130\">Planetary Motion Science Park Equipment Manufacturer In Nagpur India – Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"208\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness is a trusted <strong data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"237\">science park equipment manufacturer</strong> specializing in <strong data-end=\"325\" data-start=\"293\">educational astronomy models</strong>. Our <strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"331\">Planetary Motion science park equipment</strong> is designed to <strong data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"390\">demonstrate planetary revolution</strong> in a visually engaging way. The model clearly shows how <strong data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"483\">planets orbit the Sun faster when closer</strong> and slower when farther away, making it an ideal <strong data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"577\">interactive learning tool for schools, colleges, and science parks</strong>.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"671\" data-start=\"652\"><strong data-end=\"669\" data-start=\"652\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1296\" data-start=\"672\">\n <li data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"672\">\n <p data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"674\"><strong data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"674\">Durable & Weather-Resistant:</strong> Made with <strong data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"717\">Fibre Reinforced Polymer (FRP)</strong> curved surface (4’x4’) and grooves for smooth planetary motion</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"817\">\n <p data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"819\"><strong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"819\">Strong Framework:</strong> <strong data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"841\">Mild steel frame with powder coating (80–100 micron)</strong> ensures long-lasting outdoor durability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1073\" d