(1493, 'arch-bridge', 'Arch Bridge', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Description : </strong></p>\n\n<p><strong data-end=\"164\" data-start=\"107\">Arch Bridge Model for Science ParksManufacturerd By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India.</strong><br data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"164\">\nEnhance <strong data-end=\"218\" data-start=\"175\">engineering education and STEM learning</strong> with Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness’s <strong data-end=\"263\" data-start=\"242\">Arch Bridge Model</strong>, ideal for <strong data-end=\"313\" data-start=\"275\">science parks and educational labs</strong>. Crafted with precision, this model demonstrates <strong data-end=\"425\" data-start=\"363\">bridge mechanics, load distribution, and structural design</strong>. Features include <strong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"444\">durable construction, realistic scale, and hands-on learning applications</strong>. Perfect for <strong data-end=\"592\" data-start=\"535\">civil engineering students, teachers, and researchers</strong> to explore <strong data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"604\">arch bridge principles, stress analysis, and construction techniques</strong>.</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"141\" data-start=\"119\"><strong data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"123\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"142\">\n <li data-end=\"236\" data-start=\"142\">\n <p data-end=\"236\" data-start=\"144\"><strong data-end=\"169\" data-start=\"144\">Durable Construction:</strong> Made with high-quality, long-lasting materials for repeated use.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"325\" data-start=\"237\">\n <p data-end=\"325\" data-start=\"239\"><strong data-end=\"265\" data-start=\"239\">Accurate Scale Design:</strong> Realistic model replicating actual arch bridge structure.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"403\" data-start=\"326\">\n <p data-end=\"403\" data-start=\"328\"><strong data-end=\"353\" data-start=\"328\">Interactive Learning:</strong> Allows hands-on experiments and demonstrations.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"404\">\n <p data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"406\"><strong data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"406\">Easy Handling:</strong> Lightweight and portable for classrooms and labs.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"477\">\n <p data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"479\"><strong data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"479\">Detailed Structural Representation:</strong> Shows arch design, load distribution, and stress points.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"578\">\n <p data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"580\"><strong data-end=\"611\" data-start=\"580\">STEM & Engineering Focused:</strong> Ideal for teaching civil engineering and architecture concepts.</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"679\">\n<h3 data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"684\"><strong data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"688\">Uses</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"699\">\n <li data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"699\">\n <p data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"701\"><strong data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"701\">Educational Demonstrations:</strong> Perfect for schools, colleges, and science parks.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"785\">\n <p data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"787\"><strong data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"787\">STEM Learning Projects:</strong> Enhances understanding of physics, mechanics, and civil engineering.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"992\" data-start=\"886\">\n <p data-end=\"992\" data-start=\"888\"><strong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"888\">Bridge Engineering Studies:</strong> Demonstrates load transfer, stress analysis, and structural stability.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"993\">\n <p data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"995\"><strong data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"995\">Research & Training:</strong> Useful for engineering labs, workshops, and technical training sessions.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1095\">\n <p data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1097\"><strong data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1097\">In