(1502, 'maxima-minima-thermometer', 'Maxima Minima Thermometer', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"75\"><strong data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"79\">Maxima Minima Thermometer</strong> manufactured by <strong data-end=\"144\" data-start=\"125\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is a high-quality <strong data-end=\"202\" data-start=\"163\">science park educational instrument</strong> designed to accurately record the <strong data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"237\">maximum and minimum atmospheric temperatures</strong> over a specific period. Widely used in <strong data-end=\"416\" data-start=\"325\">science parks, outdoor laboratories, schools, colleges, and weather monitoring stations</strong>, this durable thermometer helps students and visitors understand <strong data-end=\"525\" data-start=\"482\">weather science and climate observation</strong> in a practical way.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"547\"><strong data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"547\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"565\">\n <li data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"565\">\n <p data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"567\">Accurate measurement of <strong data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"591\">maximum and minimum temperature</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"627\">\n <p data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"629\">Made with <strong data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"639\">robust, weather-resistant materials</strong> for outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"760\" data-start=\"697\">\n <p data-end=\"760\" data-start=\"699\">Clear and easy-to-read scale for educational demonstrations</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"802\" data-start=\"761\">\n <p data-end=\"802\" data-start=\"763\">Low maintenance and long service life</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"803\">\n <p data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"805\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"853\" data-start=\"815\">hands-on learning in science parks</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"855\"><strong data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"855\">Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1085\" data-start=\"865\">\n <li data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"865\">\n <p data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"867\">Temperature observation in <strong data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"894\">science parks and open labs</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"926\">\n <p data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"928\">Educational demonstrations in <strong data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"958\">schools and colleges</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"983\">\n <p data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"985\">Basic <strong data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"991\">meteorology and climate studies</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1085\" data-start=\"1027\">\n <p data-end=\"1085\" data-start=\"1029\">Environmental awareness and <strong data-end=\"1085\" data-start=\"1057\">STEM learning activities</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1322\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1087\"><strong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1087\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1104\">\nMaxima Minima Thermometer, science park equipment, educational science instruments, weather monitoring equipment, outdoor science learning tools, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness manufacturer, Nagpur, India, meteorological instruments for schools.</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '55,250', '', 7, 1, 'PFSP-95'),
