(1508, 'properties-of-triangle', 'Properties Of Triangle', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"546\" data-start=\"93\"><strong data-end=\"129\" data-start=\"97\">Properties of Triangle Model</strong> by <strong data-end=\"152\" data-start=\"133\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is a durable and educational <strong data-end=\"208\" data-start=\"182\">science park equipment</strong> designed to demonstrate fundamental <strong data-end=\"281\" data-start=\"245\">geometry and triangle properties</strong> in an interactive way. Ideal for <strong data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"315\">science parks, educational parks, schools, colleges, and outdoor learning spaces</strong>, this model helps students understand concepts such as <strong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"455\">types of triangles, angles, sides, and geometric relationships</strong> through visual learning.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"565\" data-start=\"548\"><strong data-end=\"565\" data-start=\"548\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"566\">\n <li data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"566\">\n <p data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"568\">Strong MS structure made with <strong data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"598\">50mm & 25mm square pipe</strong> and <strong data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"630\">10mm round bar</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"649\">\n <p data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"651\">Body fabricated using <strong data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"673\">1.5mm CR sheet</strong> for long-lasting performance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"811\" data-start=\"721\">\n <p data-end=\"811\" data-start=\"723\">Finished with high-quality <strong data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"750\">PU paint</strong> for weather resistance and attractive appearance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"894\" data-start=\"812\">\n <p data-end=\"894\" data-start=\"814\"><strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"814\">Fixed in ground with PCC M15 grade concrete</strong> for maximum stability and safety</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"895\">\n <p data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"897\">Suitable for <strong data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"910\">outdoor installation</strong> in science and educational parks</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"978\" data-start=\"969\"><strong data-end=\"978\" data-start=\"969\">Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1181\" data-start=\"979\">\n <li data-end=\"1045\" data-start=\"979\">\n <p data-end=\"1045\" data-start=\"981\">Teaching <strong data-end=\"1017\" data-start=\"990\">properties of triangles</strong> in mathematics and geometry</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1119\" data-start=\"1046\">\n <p data-end=\"1119\" data-start=\"1048\">Enhancing <strong data-end=\"1080\" data-start=\"1058\">practical learning</strong> in science parks and STEM environments</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1181\" data-start=\"1120\">\n <p data-end=\"1181\" data-start=\"1122\">Promoting <strong data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1132\">interactive and visual education</strong> for students</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1200\" data-start=\"1183\"><strong data-end=\"1200\" data-start=\"1183\">Product Size:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1201\">\n <li data-end=\"1221\" data-start=\"1201\">\n <p data-end=\"1221\" data-start=\"1203\">Height: <strong data-end=\"1221\" data-start=\"1211\">7 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1241\" data-start=\"1222\">\n <p data-end=\"1241\" data-start=\"1224\">Width: <strong data-end=\"1241\" data-start=\"1231\">1 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1242\">\n <p data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1244\">Length: <strong data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1252\">4 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1481\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1264\"><strong data-end=\"1281\" data-start=\"1264\">Keywords:</strong> Properties of Triangle Model, Science Park Equipment, Geometry Learning Model, Educational Park Equipment, Mathematics