(1511, 'protractor', 'Protractor', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Description</strong> :</p>\n\n<p>Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India, offers precision <strong data-end=\"191\" data-start=\"176\">protractors</strong> designed for <strong data-end=\"221\" data-start=\"205\">science labs</strong>, <strong data-end=\"249\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"223\">educational institutes</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"278\" data-start=\"255\">research facilities</strong>. Our protractors ensure <strong data-end=\"334\" data-start=\"303\">accurate angle measurements</strong> and are made from <strong data-end=\"388\" data-start=\"353\">durable, high-quality materials</strong> for long-lasting performance. <strong data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"419\">Key features</strong> include <strong data-end=\"467\" data-start=\"444\">easy-to-read scales</strong>, <strong data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"469\">sturdy construction</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"498\">versatile usage</strong> in <strong data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"521\">physics experiments, geometry studies, and technical education</strong>. Ideal for <strong data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"599\">students, teachers, and lab professionals</strong>, these protractors are essential <strong data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"678\">science lab equipment</strong> for precise and reliable results.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"491\" data-start=\"470\"><strong data-end=\"489\" data-start=\"470\">Specifications:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"492\">\n <li data-end=\"550\" data-start=\"492\">\n <p data-end=\"550\" data-start=\"494\"><strong data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"494\">Dimensions:</strong> Height 4 ft × Width 1 ft × Length 5 ft</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"551\">\n <p data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"553\"><strong data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"553\">Material:</strong> Round Pipe 25mm OD, Round Bar 10mm, Flat 40x5mm</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"617\">\n <p data-end=\"683\" data-start=\"619\"><strong data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"619\">Finish:</strong> Painted with <strong data-end=\"656\" data-start=\"644\">PU paint</strong> for corrosion resistance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"684\">\n <p data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"686\"><strong data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"686\">Installation:</strong> Fixed securely in the ground using <strong data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"739\">PCC M15 grade concrete</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"795\" data-start=\"769\"><strong data-end=\"793\" data-start=\"769\">Key Features & Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"796\">\n <li data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"796\">\n <p data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"798\">Precise <strong data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"806\">angle measurement tool</strong> for <strong data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"837\">science experiments</strong> and <strong data-end=\"895\" data-start=\"865\">educational demonstrations</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"964\" data-start=\"898\">\n <p data-end=\"964\" data-start=\"900\"><strong data-end=\"923\" data-start=\"900\">Sturdy construction</strong> suitable for <strong data-end=\"962\" data-start=\"937\">outdoor science parks</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"965\">\n <p data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"967\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"977\">students, teachers, and researchers</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1019\">\n <p data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1021\"><strong data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"1021\">Reliable and low-maintenance</strong>, designed for <strong data-end=\"1087\" data-start=\"1068\">long-term usage</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1242\" data-start=\"1091\">Enhance your <strong data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1104\">science park or educational facility</strong> with this robust, accurate, and visually appealing <strong data-end=\"1220\" data-start=\"1196\">protractor equipment</strong> by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"90\" data-start=\"79\"><strong data-end=\"88\" data-start=\"79\">Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"91\">\n <li data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"91\">\n <p data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"94\"><strong data-end=\"115\" data-start=\"94\">Angle Measurement</strong> – For precise measurement of angles in physics and geometry experiments.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"302\" data-start=\"191\">\n <p data-end=\"302\" data-start=\"194\"><strong data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"194\">Educational Demonstrations</strong> – Ideal for teaching students about angles, rotations, and basic mechanics.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"303\">\n <p data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"306\"><strong data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"306\">Science Park Installations</strong> – Serves as interactive equipment for outdoor science parks.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"400\">\n <p data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"403\"><strong data-end=\"428\" data-start=\"403\">Research Applications</strong> – Useful for lab experiments requiring accurate angular positioning.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"500\">\n <p data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"503\"><strong data-end=\"525\" data-start=\"503\">Student Engagement</strong> – Encourages hands-on learning and practical understanding of physics concepts.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"608\">\n <p data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"611\"><strong data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"611\">Durable Outdoor Learning Tool</strong> – With PU paint and concrete fixing, it’s suitable for long-term outdoor use.</p>\n </li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><strong>Keywords </strong></p>\n\n<p>Protractors for Science Park Equipment by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur, India – Durable, accurate, and ideal for educational labs, outdoor science parks, and physics experiments. Perfect for students, teachers, and research facilities requiring precise angle measurement tools.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"203\"> </p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '53,941', '', 7, 1, 'PFMP-03'),
