"965\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"967\" xss=\"removed\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"977\" xss=\"removed\">students, teachers, and researchers</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1019\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1021\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"1021\" xss=\"removed\">Reliable and low-maintenance</strong>, designed for <strong data-end=\"1087\" data-start=\"1068\" xss=\"removed\">long-term usage</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1242\" data-start=\"1091\" xss=\"removed\">Enhance your <strong data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1104\" xss=\"removed\">science park or educational facility</strong> with this robust, accurate, and visually appealing <strong data-end=\"1220\" data-start=\"1196\" xss=\"removed\">protractor equipment</strong> by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"90\" data-start=\"79\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"88\" data-start=\"79\" xss=\"removed\">Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"91\" xss=\"removed\">\n <li data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"91\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"94\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"115\" data-start=\"94\" xss=\"removed\">Angle Measurement</strong> – For precise measurement of angles in physics and geometry experiments.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"302\" data-start=\"191\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"302\" data-start=\"194\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"194\" xss=\"removed\">Educational Demonstrations</strong> – Ideal for teaching students about angles, rotations, and basic mechanics.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"303\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"306\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"306\" xss=\"removed\">Science Park Installations</strong> – Serves as interactive equipment for outdoor science parks.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"400\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"403\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"428\" data-start=\"403\" xss=\"removed\">Research Applications</strong> – Useful for lab experiments requiring accurate angular positioning.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"500\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"503\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"525\" data-start=\"503\" xss=\"removed\">Student Engagement</strong> – Encourages hands-on learning and practical understanding of physics concepts.</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"608\" xss=\"removed\">\n <p data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"611\" xss=\"removed\"><strong data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"611\" xss=\"removed\">Durable Outdoor Learning Tool</strong> – With PU paint and concrete fixing, it’s suitable for long-term outdoor use.</p>\n </li>\n</ol>\n\n<p xss=\"removed\"><strong xss=\"removed\">Keywords </strong></p>\n\n<p xss=\"removed\">Protractors for Science Park Equipment by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness India – Durable, accurate, and ideal for educational labs, outdoor science parks, and physics experiments. Perfect for students, teachers, and research facilities requiring precise angle measurement tools.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"203\" xss=\"removed\"> </p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '53,941', '', 58, 3, 'PFMP-03'),
(1514, 'cartesian-plan', 'Cartesian Plan', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description : </p>\n\n<p data-end=\"485\" data-start=\"64\"><strong data-end=\"86\" data-start=\"68\">Cartesian Plan</strong> is a durable and educational <strong data-end=\"142\" data-start=\"116\">science park equipment</strong> manufactured by <strong data-end=\"178\" data-start=\"159\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India</strong>, designed to help students understand <strong data-end=\"287\" data-start=\"217\">Cartesian coordinates, X–Y axis concepts, and basic graph plotting</strong> through interactive outdoor learning. Built with robust materials and weather-resistant finishing, it is ideal for <strong data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"403\">science parks, educational parks, schools, colleges, and STEM learning spaces</strong>.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"487\"><strong data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"487\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"822\" data-start=\"505\">\n <li data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"505\">\n <p data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"507\">Strong MS structure using <strong data-end=\"552\" data-start=\"533\">12 mm round bar</strong> and <strong data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"557\">32 OD & 25 OD round pipes</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"587\">\n <p data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"589\">High-quality <strong data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"602\">1.5 mm CR sheet</strong> for long-term durability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"649\">\n <p data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"651\"><strong data-end=\"672\" data-start=\"651\">PU painted finish</strong> for weather and corrosion resistance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"712\">\n <p data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"714\">Rigid installation with <strong data-end=\"771\" data-start=\"738\">PCC M15 grade concrete fixing</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"822\" data-start=\"774\">\n <p data-end=\"822\" data-start=\"776\">Low maintenance and suitable for outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"845\" data-start=\"824\"><strong data-end=\"845\" data-start=\"824\">Educational Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1046\" data-start=\"846\">\n <li data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"846\">\n <p data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"848\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"861\">Cartesian plane, coordinate geometry, and graph concepts</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"922\">\n <p data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"924\">Enhances <strong data-end=\"960\" data-start=\"933\">practical STEM learning</strong> in open science parks</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1046\" data-start=\"983\">\n <p data-end=\"1046\" data-start=\"985\">Encourages <strong data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"996\">interactive and visual learning</strong> for students</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1048\"><strong data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1048\">Product Size:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1066\">\n <li data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"1066\">\n <p data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"1068\">Height: <strong data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"1076\">8 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1106\" data-start=\"1087\">\n <p data-end=\"1106\" data-start=\"1089\">Width: <strong data-end=\"1106\" data-start=\"1096\">1 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1107\">\n <p data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1109\">Length: <strong data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1117\">6 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1332\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1129\"><strong data-end=\"1146\" data-start=\"1129\">Keywords:</strong> Cartesian Plan science park equipment, science park models manufacturer, educational outdoor equipment, Cartesian plane model, STEM park equipment, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness science park products, Nagpur, India</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '41,650', '', 7, 1, 'PFMP-04'),
