 data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"757\">Hinges:</strong> Heavy-duty hinges for durability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"804\">\n <p data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"806\"><strong data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"806\">Finish:</strong> High-quality PU painted surface for corrosion resistance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"972\" data-start=\"877\">\n <p data-end=\"972\" data-start=\"879\"><strong data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"879\">Installation:</strong> Fixed in the ground using <strong data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"923\">PCC M15 grade concrete</strong> for strong anchoring</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1001\" data-start=\"974\"><strong data-end=\"1001\" data-start=\"978\">Uses & Applications</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1364\" data-start=\"1002\">\n <li data-end=\"1099\" data-start=\"1002\">\n <p data-end=\"1099\" data-start=\"1004\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"1099\" data-start=\"1014\">science parks, STEM learning centers, educational parks, and outdoor laboratories</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1100\">\n <p data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1102\">Helps students understand <strong data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1128\">2D & 3D structures, net joining, geometry, and engineering principles</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1202\">\n <p data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1204\">Encourages <strong data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1215\">interactive learning, problem-solving, and hands-on experimentation</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1364\" data-start=\"1287\">\n <p data-end=\"1364\" data-start=\"1289\">Suitable for <strong data-end=\"1364\" data-start=\"1302\">schools, colleges, museums, and public science exhibitions</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1569\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1366\"><strong data-end=\"1383\" data-start=\"1366\">Keywords:</strong> 2D 3D Net Joining Equipment, Science Park Equipment Manufacturer, STEM Park Equipment, Educational Scien