(1526, 'identities', 'Identities', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"670\" data-start=\"73\">Identities Science Park Equipment by <strong data-end=\"129\" data-start=\"110\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is a robust, weather-resistant outdoor installation designed for educational and public science park environments. Manufactured using high-quality <strong data-end=\"295\" data-start=\"277\">CR sheet (2mm)</strong>, <strong data-end=\"327\" data-start=\"297\">square pipes (50mm & 25mm)</strong>, <strong data-end=\"343\" data-start=\"329\">angle 25×5</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"349\">flat 30×5</strong>, this equipment ensures long-lasting structural strength and safety. The unit is <strong data-end=\"463\" data-start=\"444\">PU paint coated</strong> for superior corrosion resistance and an attractive finish, making it ideal for outdoor use. It is securely <strong data-end=\"624\" data-start=\"572\">fixed in the ground using PCC M15 grade concrete</strong>, ensuring excellent stability and durability.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"672\"><strong data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"672\">Product Size:</strong><br data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"689\">\nHeight: 7 feet | Width: 1 feet | Length: 4 feet</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"743\"><strong data-end=\"760\" data-start=\"743\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"763\">\n <li data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"763\">\n <p data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"765\">Heavy-duty MS fabrication with CR sheet and square pipe structure</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"884\" data-start=\"833\">\n <p data-end=\"884\" data-start=\"835\">Weather-resistant PU paint finish for long life</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"885\">\n <p data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"887\">Strong and stable installation with PCC M15 concrete fixing</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"949\">\n <p data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"951\">Low ma