(1529, 'types-of-lines', 'Types Of Lines', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"64\">The <strong data-end=\"86\" data-start=\"68\">Types of Lines</strong> science park equipment by <strong data-end=\"132\" data-start=\"113\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is an educational outdoor learning model designed to help students understand different types of lines in geometry through interactive visualization. Ideal for <strong data-end=\"368\" data-start=\"293\">science parks, math parks, school playgrounds, and STEM learning spaces</strong>, this durable installation promotes hands-on learning in an engaging environment.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"452\"><strong data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"452\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"856\" data-start=\"470\">\n <li data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"470\">\n <p data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"472\">Manufactured using high-quality <strong data-end=\"534\" data-start=\"504\">square pipes (50mm & 25mm)</strong> for strong structural support</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"567\">\n <p data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"569\"><strong data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"569\">CR Sheet (2mm)</strong> and <strong data-end=\"608\" data-start=\"592\">flat 30x5 mm</strong> used for long-lasting performance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"645\">\n <p data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"647\">Robust <strong data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"654\">pin size 25x5 mm</strong> for secure assembly</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"697\">\n <p data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"699\">Finished with weather-resistant <strong data-end=\"743\" data-start=\"731\">PU paint</strong> for outdoor durability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"856\" data-start=\"769\">\n <p data-end=\"856\" data-start=\"771\">Firmly <strong data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"778\">fixed in the ground with PCC M15 grade concrete</strong> for stability and safety</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p da