ional institutions</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"861\">\n <p data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"863\">Enhances <strong data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"872\">numerical learning, counting skills, and coordination</strong> in children</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"942\">\n <p data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"944\">Supports <strong data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"953\">interactive and outdoor learning activities</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"1002\"><strong data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1083\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"1100\">\nNumber Line Model, Educational Play Equipment, Playground Learning Equipment, School Number Line Model, Outdoor Math Learning Tools, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Playground Equipment, Kids Educational Models, MS Fabricated Playground Equipment, Nagpur, India</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '55,360.50', '', 7, 1, 'PFMP-11');
