(1538, 'basic-proportionality-theorem', 'Basic Proportionality Theorem', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"579\" data-start=\"100\">Basic Proportionality Theorem (BPT) Science Park Equipment by <strong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"203\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is a durable, outdoor educational model designed to demonstrate the BPT concept clearly and interactively. Ideal for <strong data-end=\"431\" data-start=\"340\">science parks, school laboratories, educational institutes, and outdoor learning spaces</strong>, this robust science model is manufactured using high-quality steel, CR sheet, and PU paint for long-lasting performance in all weather conditions.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"581\"><strong data-end=\"598\" data-start=\"581\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"601\">\n <li data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"601\">\n <p data-end=\"651\" data-start=\"603\">Strong MS round pipe structure (32 OD & 25 OD)</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"652\">\n <p data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"654\">Heavy-duty 2 mm CR sheet construction</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"731\" data-start=\"694\">\n <p data-end=\"731\" data-start=\"696\">Weather-resistant PU paint finish</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"732\">\n <p data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"734\">Fixed installation with PCC M15 grade concrete for stability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"797\">\n <p data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"799\">Suitable for outdoor science parks and hands-on learning</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"859\"><strong data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"859\">Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"871\">\n <li data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"871\">\n <p data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"873\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"886\">Basic Proportionality Theorem</strong> in geometry</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"934\">\n <p data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"936\">Enhances practical and visual learning for students</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"990\">\n <p data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"992\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1002\">science parks, STEM labs, schools, colleges, and educational exhibitions</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1099\" data-start=\"1080\"><strong data-end=\"1097\" data-start=\"1080\">Product Size:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1100\">\n <li data-end=\"1122\" data-start=\"1100\">\n <p data-end=\"1122\" data-start=\"1102\">Height: <strong data-end=\"1120\" data-start=\"1110\">8 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1123\">\n <p data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1125\">Width: <strong data-end=\"1142\" data-start=\"1132\">1 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1145\">\n <p data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1147\">Length: <strong data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1155\">6 feet</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1413\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1167\"><strong data-end=\"1184\" data-start=\"1167\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1184\">\nBasic Proportionality Theorem model, BPT science park equipment, mathematics science park models, geometry outdoor model, science park equipment manufacturer India, educational science models, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness science equipment, Nagpur, India</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '41,650', '', 7, 1, 'PFMP-12'),
