(1541, 'types-of-quadrilateral', 'Types Of Quadrilateral', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"83\"><strong data-end=\"138\" data-start=\"112\">Types of Quadrilateral</strong> science park equipment Manufactured By Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India, designed for interactive learning in mathematics and geometry. This durable <strong data-end=\"268\" data-start=\"238\">outdoor science park model</strong> helps students understand different quadrilaterals such as square, rectangle, rhombus, parallelogram, trapezium, and kite through visual representation, making it ideal for <strong data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"442\">schools, science parks, educational institutes, and public learning spaces</strong>.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"540\" data-start=\"523\"><strong data-end=\"540\" data-start=\"523\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"904\" data-start=\"541\">\n <li data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"541\">\n <p data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"543\">High-quality <strong data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"556\">science park educational equipment</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"595\">\n <p data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"597\">Strong structure made with <strong data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"624\">25mm square pipe</strong> and <strong data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"649\">25×5 angle</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"664\">\n <p data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"666\"><strong data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"666\">2mm CR sheet</strong> for long-lasting performance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"712\">\n <p data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"714\">Weather-resistant <strong data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"732\">PU painted finish</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"807\" data-start=\"754\">\n <p data-end=\"807\" data-start=\"756\">Rigid installation using <strong data-end=\"807\" data-start=\"781\">PCC M15 grade concrete</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"808\">\n <p data-end=\"864\" data-start=