(1544, 'tangents-of-circle', 'Tangents Of Circle', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-2\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"6cccb588-fb83-4148-9d80-a683af3a4f23\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"78b5e0de-b103-4b30-bfbe-c0e454a04b94\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\" dir=\"auto\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling\">\n<p data-end=\"523\" data-start=\"81\">Tangents of Circle is an interactive <strong data-end=\"156\" data-start=\"118\">science park educational equipment</strong> designed to demonstrate geometric concepts in a practical, hands-on way. Manufactured by <strong data-end=\"265\" data-start=\"246\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India</strong>, this durable outdoor learning model is ideal for <strong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"316\">science parks, schools, STEM labs, and educational playgrounds</strong>. It helps students easily understand the concept of <strong data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"435\">tangents to a circle</strong> through real-time mechanical movement and visual demonstration.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"542\" data-start=\"525\"><strong data-end=\"542\" data-start=\"525\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"878\" data-start=\"543\">\n <li data-end=\"611\" data-start=\"543\">\n <p data-end=\"611\" data-start=\"545\">Strong MS structure using <strong data-end=\"595\" data-start=\"571\">square & round pipes</strong> for long life</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"612\">\n <p data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"614\">Smooth mechanical operation with <strong data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"647\">cycle ring, sprocket & wire rope system</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"693\">\n <p data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"695\">Weather-resistant <strong data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"713\">PU paint coating</strong> for outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"819\" data-start=\"752\">\n <p data-end=\"819\" data-start=\"754\">Heavy-duty <strong data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"765\">pin-supported mechanism</strong> for safety and stability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"878\" data-start=\"820\">\n <p data-end=\"878\" data-start=\"822\">Firmly <strong data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"829\">fixed in ground with PCC M15 grade concrete</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"880\"><strong data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"965\">Uses & Applications:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1247\" data-start=\"990\">\n <li data-end=\"1060\" data-start=\"990\">\n <p data-end=\"1060\" data-start=\"992\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"1058\" data-start=\"1002\">science parks, mathematics parks, schools & colleges</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"1061\">\n <p data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"1063\">Enhances <strong data-end=\"1090\" data-start=\"1072\">STEM education</strong> with practical learning</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1117\">\n <p data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1119\">Best for demonstrating <strong data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1142\">geometry concepts, tangents of circle & angles</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1247\" data-start=\"1195\">\n <p data-end=\"1247\" data-start=\"1197\">Suitable for <strong data-end=\"1247\" data-start=\"1210\">outdoor educational installations</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1540\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1249\"><strong data-end=\"1266\" data-start=\"1249\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1269\" data-start=\"1266\">\nTangents of Circle science park equipment, science park model manufacturer India, educational science park equipment, math park instruments, geometry learning equipment, STEM outdoor learning tools, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness science park equipment, interactive science models, Nagpur, India</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '48,263', '', 7, 1, 'PFMP-14'),
