(1547, 'factor-tree', 'Factor Tree', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"88\">The <strong data-end=\"130\" data-start=\"92\">Factor Tree Science Park Equipment</strong> by <strong data-end=\"153\" data-start=\"134\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is an interactive <strong data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"172\">math learning outdoor science park model</strong> designed to help students understand <strong data-end=\"306\" data-start=\"254\">factors, prime numbers, and number decomposition</strong> through hands-on learning. Made with <strong data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"344\">heavy-duty MS structure</strong>, this <strong data-end=\"416\" data-start=\"378\">educational science park equipment</strong> is ideal for <strong data-end=\"497\" data-start=\"430\">schools, science parks, math parks, and outdoor learning spaces</strong>.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"500\"><strong data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"500\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"518\">\n <li data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"518\">\n <p data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"520\">Strong <strong data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"527\">square pipe 25 mm</strong> and <strong data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"553\">25 × 5 mm angle frame</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"623\" data-start=\"581\">\n <p data-end=\"623\" data-start=\"583\">Durable <strong data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"591\">2 mm CR sheet construction</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"624\">\n <p data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"626\">Weather-resistant <strong data-end=\"665\" data-start=\"644\">PU painted finish</strong> for long outdoor life</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"690\">\n <p data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"692\">Firmly <strong data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"699\">fixed in ground with PCC M15 grade concrete</strong> for safety and stability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"774\">\n <p data-end=\"832\" data-start=\"776\">Low maintenance, child-safe edges, long-lasting design</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"843\" data-start=\"834\"><strong data-end=\"843\" data-start=\"834\">Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"844\">\n <li data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"844\">\n <p data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"846\">Helps students visualize and learn <strong data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"881\">factor tree concepts</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"969\" data-start=\"908\">\n <p data-end=\"969\" data-start=\"910\">Encourages <strong data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"921\">interactive STEM and mathematics education</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"970\">\n <p data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"972\">Suitable for <strong data-end=\"1053\" data-start=\"985\">science parks, educational parks, schools, colleges, and museums</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1128\" data-start=\"1055\"><strong data-end=\"1072\" data-start=\"1055\">Product Size:</strong><br data-end=\"1075\" data-start=\"1072\">\nHeight: <strong data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1083\">5 ft</strong> | Width: <strong data-end=\"1109\" data-start=\"1101\">1 ft</strong> | Length: <strong data-end=\"1128\" data-start=\"1120\">4 ft</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1349\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1130\"><strong data-end=\"1147\" data-start=\"1130\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1150\" data-start=\"1147\">\nFactor Tree Science Park Equipment, Math Park Equipment Manufacturer, Science Park Models India, Educational Science Equipment, Outdoor Math Learning Equipment, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Science Park Equipment, Nagpur, India</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '39,950', '', 7, 1, 'PFMP-15'),
