(1577, 'square-root-spiral', 'Square Root Spiral', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"58\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"58\" data-start=\"0\">Square Root Spiral Science Equipment – Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"401\" data-start=\"60\">The <strong data-end=\"109\" data-start=\"64\">Square Root Spiral Science Park Equipment</strong> by <strong data-end=\"132\" data-start=\"113\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is an interactive outdoor math learning model designed to demonstrate number patterns and square root concepts visually. Ideal for science parks, STEM labs, schools, and educational gardens, it encourages experiential learning through durable, child-safe construction.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"427\" data-start=\"403\"><strong data-end=\"427\" data-start=\"403\">Key Features & Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"428\">\n <li data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"428\">\n <p data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"430\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"443\">square root spiral / number spiral</strong> concepts in an engaging way</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"512\">\n <p data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"514\">Strong fabrication using <strong data-end=\"612\" data-start=\"539\">25mm square pipe, 32 OD & 25 OD round pipes, round bars (12mm & 10mm)</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"664\" data-start=\"615\">\n <p data-end=\"664\" data-start=\"617\"><strong data-end=\"633\" data-start=\"617\">2mm CR sheet</strong> for long-lasting performance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"665\">\n <p data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"667\">Weather-resistant <strong data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"685\">PU paint finish</strong> for outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"723\">\n <p data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"725\">Secure installation with <strong data-end=\"776\" data-start=\"750\">PCC M15 grade concrete</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"779\">\n <p data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"781\">Suitable for <strong data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"794\">science parks, schools, colleges, math labs & STEM learning areas</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"935\" data-start=\"865\"><strong data-end=\"954\" data-start=\"937\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"957\" data-start=\"954\">\nSquare Root Spiral science equipment, science park math equipment, outdoor math learning model, STEM park equipment manufacturer, educational science park models, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness science equipment, Nagpur, India, interactive math science park equipment, durable science park installations.</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '62,730', '', 7, 1, 'PFMP-25'),
