(1592, 'veins-your-body', 'Veins Your Body', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"95\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"59\" data-start=\"0\">Veins In Your Body – Science Park Educational Equipment</strong><br data-end=\"62\" data-start=\"59\">\n<em data-end=\"95\" data-start=\"62\">Manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</em></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"619\" data-start=\"97\">Veins In Your Body is an interactive science park equipment designed to visually demonstrate blood circulation in the human body. Manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India, this educational exhibit uses LED strip lighting to represent the flow of blood through major veins and arteries, making complex biological concepts easy to understand. Ideal for science parks, schools, museums, and anatomy learning centers, this durable model enhances experiential learning through visual engagement.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"621\"><strong data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"621\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"641\">\n <li data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"641\">\n <p data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"643\">Interactive LED strips to illustrate real-time blood flow in veins and arteries</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"725\">\n <p data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"727\">Scientifically accurate representation of the human circulatory system</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"800\">\n <p data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"802\">Fabricated using high-quality plastic for long-lasting performance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"871\">\n <p data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"873\">Strong metallic support stand made from MS pipes and MS angles</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1009\" data-start=\"938\">\n <p data-end=\"1009\" data-start=\"940\">Attractive, educational design suitable for indoor science exhibits</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"1010\">\n <p data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"1012\">Low maintenance and energy-efficient lighting system</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"1068\"><strong data-end=\"1092\" data-start=\"1068\">Uses / Applications:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1095\">\n <li data-end=\"1135\" data-start=\"1095\">\n <p data-end=\"1135\" data-start=\"1097\">Science parks and innovation centers</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1179\" data-start=\"1136\">\n <p data-end=\"1179\" data-start=\"1138\">Educational institutes and biology labs</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1180\">\n <p data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1182\">Museums and medical awareness exhibitions</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1273\" data-start=\"1226\">\n <p data-end=\"1273\" data-start=\"1228\">Anatomy and human physiology demonstrations</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1274\">\n <p data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1276\">Student engagement and interactive learning programs</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1332\"><strong data-end=\"1361\" data-start=\"1332\">Technical Specifications:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1578\" data-start=\"1364\">\n <li data-end=\"1382\" data-start=\"1364\">\n <p data-end=\"1382\" data-start=\"1366\">Height: 5 feet</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1401\" data-start=\"1383\">\n <p data-end=\"1401\" data-start=\"1385\">Length: 3 feet</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1402\">\n <p data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1404\">Width: 3 feet</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1459\" data-start=\"1420\">\n <p data-end=\"1459\" data-start=\"1422\">Material: High-quality plastic body</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1524\" data-start=\"1460\">\n <p data-end=\"1524\" data-start=\"1462\">Stand: Metallic stand fabricated with MS pipes and MS angles</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1578\" data-start=\"1525\">\n <p data-end=\"1578\" data-start=\"1527\">Visual Effect: LED strips to represent blood flow</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1915\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" d