(1595, 'hydro-turbine', 'Hydro Turbine', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"263\" data-start=\"188\"><strong data-end=\"263\" data-start=\"188\">Hydro Turbine Science Park Equipment | Working Model by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"265\">The <strong data-end=\"309\" data-start=\"269\">Hydro Turbine Science Park Equipment</strong> manufactured by <strong data-end=\"345\" data-start=\"326\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is a scaled, working educational model designed to demonstrate the principles of <strong data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"427\">hydropower generation</strong>. This interactive model showcases <strong data-end=\"582\" data-start=\"487\">three major types of hydro turbines – Tangential Flow, Radial Flow, and Axial Flow turbines</strong>, making it ideal for science parks, engineering colleges, and renewable energy exhibitions.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"676\"><strong data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"676\">Concept:</strong><br data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"688\">\nA scaled working model illustrating the operation and flow mechanism of <strong data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"763\">tangential, radial, and axial flow hydro turbines</strong>, helping students understand energy conversion from flowing water to mechanical power.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"924\" data-start=\"905\"><strong data-end=\"922\" data-start=\"905\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1349\" data-start=\"925\">\n <li data-end=\"993\" data-start=\"925\">\n <p data-end=\"993\" data-start=\"927\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"940\">three types of hydro turbines</strong> in a single model</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"994\">\n <p data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"996\">Realistic <strong data-end=\"1041\" data-start=\"1006\">water flow and turbine rotation</strong> for effective learning</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"1067\">\n <p data-end=