(1598, 'solar-tree', 'Solar Tree', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Description :</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"73\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"73\" data-start=\"0\">Solar Tree – Science Park Equipment | Manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"553\" data-start=\"75\">The <strong data-end=\"93\" data-start=\"79\">Solar Tree</strong> by <strong data-end=\"116\" data-start=\"97\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> is an innovative, eco-friendly <strong data-end=\"174\" data-start=\"148\">science park equipment</strong> designed to demonstrate renewable energy in a visually engaging way. This compact solar tree model efficiently generates and stores solar power while showcasing the concept of sustainable energy through a nature-inspired structure. Ideal for <strong data-end=\"507\" data-start=\"417\">science parks, educational institutes, exhibitions, public gardens, and green campuses</strong>, it combines learning with practical utility.</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"574\" data-start=\"555\"><strong>Key Features :</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1111\" data-start=\"575\">\n <li data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"575\">\n <p data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"577\">Innovative <strong data-end=\"612\" data-start=\"588\">solar tree structure</strong> with panels arranged like branches and leaves</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"661\">\n <p data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"663\"><strong data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"663\">Electricity storage system</strong> with inbuilt battery</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"717\">\n <p data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"719\"><strong data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"719\">DC to AC converter</strong> for usable power output</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"843\" data-start=\"768\">\n <p data-end=\"843\" data-start=\"770\">Integrated <strong data-end=\"801\" data-start=\"781\">plug point board</strong> for charging and small electrical usage</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"844\">\n <p data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"846\">Strong central stem made of <strong data-end=\"906\" data-start=\"874\">MS pipes and MS angle frames</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"909\">\n <p data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"911\">Durable construction finished with <strong data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"946\">high-quality PU paint</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1056\" data-start=\"974\">\n <p data-end=\"1056\" data-start=\"976\">Compact design – a smaller version suitable for indoor & outdoor installations</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1111\" data-start=\"1057\">\n <p data-end=\"1111\" data-start=\"1059\">Low maintenance, weather-resistant, and long-lasting</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1113\">⚙️ <strong>Technical Specifications :</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1145\">\n <li data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1145\">\n <p data-end=\"1168\" data-start=\"1147\"><strong data-end=\"1158\" data-start=\"1147\">Height:</strong> 10 feet</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1169\">\n <p data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1171\"><strong data-end=\"1184\" data-start=\"1171\">Diameter:</strong> 10 feet</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1248\" data-start=\"1195\">\n <p data-end=\"1248\" data-start=\"1197\"><strong data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1197\">Material:</strong> MS Pipes & MS Angle Frame Structure</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1289\" data-start=\"1249\">\n <p data-end=\"1289\" data-start=\"1251\"><strong data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1251\">Finish:</strong> Premium PU Paint Coating</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1290\">\n <p data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1292\"><strong data-end=\"1309\" data-start=\"1292\">Solar Panels:</strong> Aesthetically arranged to resemble tree branches & leaves</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1443\" data-start=\"1370\">\n <p data-end=\"1443\" data-start=\"1372\"><strong data-end=\"1389\" data-start=\"1372\">Power System:</strong> Solar panels + batter