removed>\n <p data-end=\"1289\" data-start=\"1251\" xss=removed><strong data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1251\" xss=removed>Finish:</strong> Premium PU Paint Coating</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1290\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1292\" xss=removed><strong data-end=\"1309\" data-start=\"1292\" xss=removed>Solar Panels:</strong> Aesthetically arranged to resemble tree branches & leaves</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1443\" data-start=\"1370\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1443\" data-start=\"1372\" xss=removed><strong data-end=\"1389\" data-start=\"1372\" xss=removed>Power System:</strong> Solar panels + battery storage + DC to AC converter</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1444\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1446\" xss=removed><strong data-end=\"1457\" data-start=\"1446\" xss=removed>Output:</strong> Plug point board for direct usage</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1519\" data-start=\"1493\" xss=removed><strong xss=removed>Uses & Applications :</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1713\" data-start=\"1520\" xss=removed>\n <li data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1520\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1522\" xss=removed>Science parks & innovation centers</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1559\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1561\" xss=removed>School & college laboratories</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1636\" data-start=\"1593\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1636\" data-start=\"1595\" xss=removed>Renewable energy demonstration projects</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1671\" data-start=\"1637\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1671\" data-start=\"1639\" xss=removed>Public awareness installations</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1713\" data-start=\"1672\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1713\" data-start=\"1674\" xss=removed>Smart city & green energy initiatives</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"2025\" data-start=\"1715\" xss=removed><strong data-end=\"1732\" data-start=\"1715\" xss=removed>Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1735\" data-start=\"1732\" xss=removed>\nSolar Tree science park equipment, India, solar tree model manufacturer, renewable energy science park equipment, educational solar model, solar tree for schools, science park solar equipment India, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness solar tree, sustainable energy demonstration model, solar power teaching equipment</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1,68,300', '', 58, 3, 'PFSP-102'),
(1601, 'pendulum-wave', 'Pendulum Wave', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Description :</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"76\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"76\" data-start=\"0\">Pendulum Wave – Science Park Equipment | Manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India.</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"78\">The <strong data-end=\"99\" data-start=\"82\">Pendulum Wave</strong> is an engaging and educational <strong data-end=\"157\" data-start=\"131\">science park equipment</strong> designed to demonstrate principles of <strong data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"196\">wave motion, periodic motion, resonance, and optical illusion</strong>. Manufactured by <strong data-end=\"298\" data-start=\"279\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong>, this interactive exhibit creates a fascinating visual illusion by allowing <strong data-end=\"439\" data-start=\"375\">varying intensity and timing of motion perceived by each eye</strong>, resulting in a mesmerizing wave pattern.</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"483\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"503\">\n <li data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"503\">\n <p data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"505\">High-quality <strong data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"518\">science park educational equipment</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"557\">\n <p data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"559\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"572\">pendulum motion, wave patterns & time period variation</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"710\" data-start=\"631\">\n <p data-end=\"710\" data-start=\"633\">Creates a unique <strong data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"650\">optical illusion effect</strong> through synchronized pendulums</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"711\">\n <p data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"713\">Strong, weather-resistant structure suitable for <strong data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"762\">outdoor science parks</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"834\" data-start=\"788\">\n <p data-end=\"834\" data-start=\"790\">Low maintenance and long-lasting performance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"835\">\n <p data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"837\">Safe and interactive learning tool for all age groups</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"892\"><strong>Uses & Applications</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"919\">\n <li data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"919\">\n <p data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"921\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"931\">science parks, science centers, museums & STEM labs</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"987\">\n <p data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"989\">Helps students understand <strong data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"1015\">physics concepts</strong> like oscillation, frequency, and wave interference</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1087\">\n <p data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1089\">Enhances <strong data-end=\"1119\" data-start=\"1098\">hands-on learning</strong> and visual curiosity</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1141\">\n <p data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1143\">Popular attraction in <strong data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1165\">educational playgrounds and innovation parks</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"1215\"><strong>Keywords</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1503\" data-start=\"1235\">Pendulum Wave science park equipment, Nagpur, India, science park educational models, physics demonstration equipment, interactive science exhibits, wave motion equipment, outdoor science park instruments, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness science equipment manufacturer, STEM learning equipment India</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '83,300', '', 7, 1, 'PFSP-103'),
