>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"711\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"713\" xss=removed>Strong, weather-resistant structure suitable for <strong data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"762\" xss=removed>outdoor science parks</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"834\" data-start=\"788\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"834\" data-start=\"790\" xss=removed>Low maintenance and long-lasting performance</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"835\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"837\" xss=removed>Safe and interactive learning tool for all age groups</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"892\" xss=removed><strong xss=removed>Uses & Applications</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"919\" xss=removed>\n <li data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"919\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"921\" xss=removed>Ideal for <strong data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"931\" xss=removed>science parks, science centers, museums & STEM labs</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"987\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"989\" xss=removed>Helps students understand <strong data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"1015\" xss=removed>physics concepts</strong> like oscillation, frequency, and wave interference</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1087\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1089\" xss=removed>Enhances <strong data-end=\"1119\" data-start=\"1098\" xss=removed>hands-on learning</strong> and visual curiosity</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1141\" xss=removed>\n <p data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1143\" xss=removed>Popular attraction in <strong data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1165\" xss=removed>educational playgrounds and innovation parks</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"1215\" xss=removed><strong xss=removed>Keywords</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1503\" data-start=\"1235\" xss=removed>Pendulum Wave science park equipment, India, science park educational models, physics demonstration equipment, interactive science exhibits, wave motion equipment, outdoor science park instruments, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness science equipment manufacturer, STEM learning equipment India</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '83,300', '', 58, 3, 'PFSP-103');
