(1604, 'babel-drums', 'Babel Drums', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"66\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"66\" data-start=\"0\">Babel Drums – Musical Science Park Equipment | Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"605\" data-start=\"68\">Babel Drums by <strong data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"124\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India,</strong> are premium <strong data-end=\"192\" data-start=\"156\">science park musical instruments</strong> designed to inspire creativity, relaxation, and interactive learning. Made from high-quality <strong data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"286\">stainless steel</strong>, these circular tongue drums produce soothing melodies with <strong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"366\">long sustain</strong>, making them ideal for <strong data-end=\"491\" data-start=\"406\">outdoor science parks, musical gardens, sensory parks, and therapeutic play areas</strong>. Suitable for <strong data-end=\"524\" data-start=\"506\">all age groups</strong>, Babel Drums encourage hands-on engagement through sound, rhythm, and vibration.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"610\" data-start=\"607\">\n<h3 data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"612\"><strong data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"616\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"633\">\n <li data-end=\"685\" data-start=\"633\">\n <p data-end=\"685\" data-start=\"635\"><strong data-end=\"665\" data-start=\"638\">Beautiful Melodic Sound</strong> with long sustain</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"686\">\n <p data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"688\"><strong data-end=\"719\" data-start=\"692\">Durable Stainless Steel</strong> – weather-resistant for outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"810\" data-start=\"758\">\n <p data-end=\"810\" data-start=\"760\"><strong data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"763\">Ideal for Science Parks & Musical Gardens</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"811\">\n <p data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"813\"><strong data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"816\">Supports Sensory Learning & Musical Therapy</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"866\">\n <p data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"868\"><strong data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"873\">Safe & Engaging for All Ages</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"908\">\n <p data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"910\"><strong data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"913\">Pentatonic Scale</strong> – harmonious notes, no wrong sounds</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"973\"><strong data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"973\">Variants:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1098\" data-start=\"987\">\n <li data-end=\"1042\" data-start=\"987\">\n <p data-end=\"1042\" data-start=\"989\"><strong data-end=\"1009\" data-start=\"989\">Babel Drum Small</strong> – <strong><em data-end=\"1040\" data-start=\"1012\">C Major Pentatonic (C4–C5)</em></strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1098\" data-start=\"1043\">\n <p data-end=\"1098\" data-start=\"1045\"><strong data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1045\">Babel Drum Large</strong> – <strong><em data-end=\"1096\" data-start=\"1068\">G Major Pentatonic (G3–B4)</em></strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"1100\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1132\" data-start=\"1105\"><strong data-end=\"1132\" data-start=\"1109\">Uses / Applications</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1358\" data-start=\"1133\">\n <li data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1133\">\n <p data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1135\">Science Parks & Outdoor Playgrounds</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1202\" data-start=\"1173\">\n <p data-end=\"1202\" data-start=\"1175\">Musical & Sensory Gardens</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1237\" data-start=\"1203\">\n <p data-end=\"1237\" data-start=\"1205\">Children’s Parks & Theme Parks</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1276\" data-start=\"1238\">\n <p data-end=\"1276\" data-start=\"1240\">Schools & Educational Institutions</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1277\">\n <p data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1279\"><