(1626, 'world-time-globe-round', 'World Time Globe Round', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"63\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"63\" data-start=\"0\">World Time Globe Round Model Science Park Equipment Manufacturers In Nagpur India</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"531\" data-start=\"65\">The <strong data-end=\"112\" data-start=\"69\">World Time Globe </strong><strong data-end=\"63\" data-start=\"0\">Round Model </strong><strong data-end=\"112\" data-start=\"69\">Science Park Equipment</strong>, manufactured by <strong data-end=\"149\" data-start=\"130\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur</strong>, is an interactive educational model designed to help students understand <strong data-end=\"320\" data-start=\"224\">global time zones, Earth’s rotation, longitude, UTC offsets, and the International Date Line</strong>. Ideal for science parks, school laboratories, STEM parks, and outdoor learning areas, this compact yet informative globe makes geography and astronomy concepts easy and engaging for learners of all age groups.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"533\"><strong data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"533\">Size & Specifications:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"560\">\n <li data-end=\"593\" data-start=\"560\">\n <p data-end=\"593\" data-start=\"562\"><strong data-end=\"581\" data-start=\"562\">Table Diameter:</strong> 20 inches</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"624\" data-start=\"594\">\n <p data-end=\"624\" data-start=\"596\"><strong data-end=\"613\" data-start=\"596\">Total Height:</strong> 6 inches</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"625\">\n <p data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"627\"><strong data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"627\">Materials:</strong> Mild Steel (MS) structure, FRP globe, high-quality vinyl print</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"707\">\n <p data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"709\"><strong data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"709\">Design:</strong> Durable, weather-resistant, manual or semi-automatic 