(1677, 'ellipse-table', 'Ellipse Table', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p data-end=\"60\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"60\" data-start=\"0\">Ellipse Table - Science Park Equipment | Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"540\" data-start=\"62\">The <strong data-end=\"138\" data-start=\"66\">Ellipse Table Science Park Equipment manufactured by Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur</strong> is an interactive, outdoor <strong data-end=\"188\" data-start=\"166\">science park model</strong> designed to demonstrate <strong data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"213\">elliptical motion, oscillation, frequency, phase difference, and Lissajous figures</strong> in a fun, hands-on way. Made from <strong data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"334\">heavy-duty iron structure</strong>, this durable <strong data-end=\"402\" data-start=\"378\">science park exhibit</strong> is ideal for <strong data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"416\">children aged 8 years and above</strong>, helping them easily visualize complex <strong data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"491\">physics concepts</strong> through play-based learning.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"542\"><strong data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"542\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"560\">\n <li data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"560\">\n <p data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"562\">Strong & weather-resistant <strong data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"589\">iron fabrication</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"610\">\n <p data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"612\">Interactive demonstration of <strong data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"641\">elliptical motion & wave interference</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"683\">\n <p data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"685\">Creates <strong data-end=\"715\" data-start=\"693\">Lissajous patterns</strong> like ellipses, circles, and figure-eight shapes</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"766\">\n <p data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"768\">Safe, low-maintenance, and suitable for <strong data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"808\">outdoor science parks</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"834\">\n <p data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"836\">Enhances <strong data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"845\">STEM learning</strong> with hands-on experience</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"898\" data-start=\"889\"><strong data-end=\"898\" data-start=\"889\">Uses:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"899\">\n <li data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"899\">\n <p data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"901\">Science parks & science centers</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"972\" data-start=\"935\">\n <p data-end=\"972\" data-start=\"937\">Educational playgrounds & schools</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"973\">\n <p data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"975\">Physics learning & STEM education zones</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1307\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1018\"><strong data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"1018\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"1035\">\nEllipse Table Science Park Equipment, Ellipse Table Model, Science Park Physics Equipment, Interactive Science Park Exhibits, Lissajous Figure Demonstration, Outdoor Science Park Equipment Manufacturer, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Science Park Models, STEM Learning Equipment Nagpur India.</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,000', '', 7, 1, 'PFSP-150');
