(1686, 'conical-section', 'Conical Section', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"60\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"60\" data-start=\"0\">Conical Section Science Park Equipment – Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India.</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"62\">Conical Section Science Park Equipment manufactured by <strong data-end=\"136\" data-start=\"117\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur,</strong> is an innovative outdoor <strong data-end=\"184\" data-start=\"162\">science park model</strong> designed to demonstrate <strong data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"209\">gravity, center of gravity, equilibrium, and motion</strong> in a fun and interactive way. Commonly known as the <strong data-end=\"332\" data-start=\"317\">Double Cone</strong> or <strong data-end=\"351\" data-start=\"336\">Uphill Cone</strong>, this equipment creates the illusion of a cone rolling uphill, while scientifically proving that its <strong data-end=\"489\" data-start=\"453\">center of gravity moves downward</strong>.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"492\"><strong data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"492\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"510\">\n <li data-end=\"581\" data-start=\"510\">\n <p data-end=\"581\" data-start=\"512\">Made from <strong data-end=\"550\" data-start=\"522\">high-quality FRP / metal</strong> for long-lasting outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"582\">\n <p data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"584\"><strong data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"584\">Weather-resistant, low maintenance</strong> and safe for students</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"647\">\n <p data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"649\">Interactive design for <strong data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"672\">hands-on learning</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"696\">\n <p data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"698\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"708\">science parks, schools, colleges, and exhibitions</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"763\"><strong data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"763\">Uses & Educational Value:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"793\">\n <li data-end=\"854\" data-start=\"793\">\n <p data-end=\"854\" data-start=\"795\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"808\">gravity, center of mass, and equilibrium</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"855\">\n <p data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"857\">Helps students understand <strong data-end=\"916\" data-start=\"883\">physics concepts through play</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"919\">\n <p data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"921\">Converts abstract scientific theories into <strong data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"964\">visual and practical learning</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1310\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"999\"><strong data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"999\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"1016\">\nConical Section Science Park Equipment Nagpur India, Double Cone Science Model, Uphill Cone Physics Equipment, Science Park Educational Equipment, FRP Science Park Models, Gravity Demonstration Equipment, Center of Gravity Science Model, Physics Learning Equipment, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Science Park Equipment</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '32,500', '', 7, 1, 'PFSP-153'),
