(1698, 'xy-coordinates-game', 'XY Coordinates Game', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"66\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"66\" data-start=\"0\">XY Coordinates Game – Science Park Equipment | Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur India.</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"433\" data-start=\"68\">The <strong data-end=\"95\" data-start=\"72\">XY Coordinates Game</strong> is an innovative <strong data-end=\"151\" data-start=\"113\">science park educational equipment</strong> manufactured by <strong data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"168\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Nagpur</strong>, designed to make learning mathematics fun and interactive. Ideal for <strong data-end=\"284\" data-start=\"258\">children above 8 years</strong>, this outdoor learning tool helps students understand the <strong data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"343\">Cartesian coordinate system &#40;X-axis and Y-axis&#41;</strong> through hands-on, play-way activities.</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"435\">Key Features</h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"452\">\n <li data-end=\"513\" data-start=\"452\">\n <p data-end=\"513\" data-start=\"454\">Interactive <strong data-end=\"493\" data-start=\"466\">STEM learning equipment</strong> for science parks</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"514\">\n <p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"516\">Durable, weather-resistant outdoor design</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"620\" data-start=\"560\">\n <p data-end=\"620\" data-start=\"562\">Clear marking of <strong data-end=\"595\" data-start=\"579\">X and Y axes</strong> for easy understanding</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"621\">\n <p data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"623\">Encourages logical thinking, visualization, and problem-solving</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"689\">\n <p data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"691\">Suitable for schools, science parks, and educational playgrounds</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"759\">Uses & Benefits</h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"779\">\n <li data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"779\">\n <p data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"781\">Helps students plot <strong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"801\">points, lines, and geometric shapes</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"843\">\n <p data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"845\">Strengthens concepts of <strong data-end=\"906\" data-start=\"869\">coordinates, graphs, and geometry</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"909\">\n <p data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"911\">Promotes experiential learning through play</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"957\">\n <p data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"959\">Enhances mathematical and analytical skills</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1272\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1006\"><strong data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"1006\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"1023\">\nXY Coordinates Game, Nagpur, India, Science Park Equipment Manufacturer, Outdoor Math Learning Equipment, STEM Park Games, Educational Science Park Games, Cartesian Coordinate System Game, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness Science Equipment, Interactive Math Playground Equipment</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '34,000', '', 7, 1, 'PFSP-156'),
