ong-lasting equipment</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"717\"><strong data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"717\">Uses & Educational Value:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"747\">\n <li data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"747\">\n <p data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"749\">Helps students understand <strong data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"775\">gravity, time period & oscillation</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"888\" data-start=\"814\">\n <p data-end=\"888\" data-start=\"816\">Practical example of <strong data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"837\">physics concepts</strong> used in clocks and tetherballs</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"889\">\n <p data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"891\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"901\">science parks, STEM labs, schools & educational institutes</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"964\">\n <p data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"966\">Encourages <strong data-end=\"998\" data-start=\"977\">hands-on learning</strong> and curiosity in science</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1303\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1025\"><strong data-end=\"1042\" data-start=\"1025\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1045\" data-start=\"1042\">\nSwing is a Pendulum, Science Park Equipment Manufacturer, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness, Outdoor Science Park Models, Physics Science Equipment, Pendulum Demonstration Model, Educational Playground Equipment, STEM Learning Equipment, Interactive Science Park Installations, Nagpur, India.</p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '34,000', '', 25, 1, 'PF-416'),
