(1709, 'newtons-cradle', 'Newton\'s Cradle', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Description :</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"62\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"62\" data-start=\"0\">Newton’s Cradle – Science Park Equipment | Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness India.</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"64\">Newton’s Cradle is a durable and interactive <strong data-end=\"135\" data-start=\"109\">science park equipment</strong> manufactured by <strong data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"152\">Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness India</strong>, designed to demonstrate core physics concepts like <strong data-end=\"252\" data-start=\"224\">conservation of momentum</strong> and <strong data-end=\"291\" data-start=\"257\">conservation of kinetic energy</strong> through elastic collisions. Ideal for <strong data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"330\">science parks, STEM parks, educational institutes, and outdoor learning spaces</strong>, this exhibit offers hands-on learning with long-lasting construction.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"485\"><strong data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"485\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"503\">\n <li data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"503\">\n <p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"505\">Total exhibit size (L × B × H): <strong data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"537\">3’6” × 2’6” × 6’0”</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"631\" data-start=\"560\">\n <p data-end=\"631\" data-start=\"562\"><strong data-end=\"584\" data-start=\"562\">Fixed installation</strong> using <strong data-end=\"617\" data-start=\"591\">PCC M15 grade concrete</strong> for stability</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"632\">\n <p data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"634\">Top frame fabricated with <strong data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"660\">¾” ‘B’ Class GI Pipe (2 mm thickness)</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"702\">\n <p data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"704\">Side supports of <strong data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"721\">1½” GI Pipe (2.5 mm thickness)</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"756\">\n <p data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"758\"><strong data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"758\">7 Nos. of 3” SS steel balls</strong> suspended</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"800\">\n <p data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"802\">Hanging system using <strong data-end=\"841\" data-start=\"823\">4 mm iron rope</strong> with <strong data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"847\">1” GI Pipe (26”)</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"868\">\n <p data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"870\">Weather-resistant, low maintenance, suitable for outdoor use</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"932\"><strong data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"932\">Uses & Applications:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"957\">\n <li data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"957\">\n <p data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"959\">Demonstrates <strong data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"972\">Newton’s Laws of Motion</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"1000\">\n <p data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"1002\">Visualizes <strong data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"1013\">momentum transfer</strong> and <strong data-end=\"1062\" data-start=\"1039\">energy conservation</strong></p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1063\">\n <p data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1065\">Enhances <strong data-end=\"1099\" data-start=\"1074\">experiential learning</strong> in science parks and STEM installations</p>\n </li>\n <li data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1140\">\n <p data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1142\">Suitable for <strong data-end=\"1216\" data-start=\"1155\">school science parks, museums, and public science centers</strong></p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1218\"><strong data-end=\"1231\" data-start=\"1218\">Services:</strong><br>\nSarwadnya Sports And Fitness provides <strong data-end=\"1300\" data-start=\"1257\">manufacturing, supply, and installation</strong> of Newton’s Cradle science exhibits with precise engineering and quality materials.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1676\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1386\"><strong data-end=\"1403\" data-start=\"1386\">Keywords:</strong><br data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1403\">\nNewton’s Cradle science park equipment, science park exhibits manufacturer, educational science equipment India, STEM park outdoor exhibits, physics demonstration equipment, Newton’s laws exhibit, Sarwadnya Sports And Fitness science equipment, momentum and energy conservation model, India.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, '25,000', '', 58, 3, 'PFSP-157'),
