(28, '', 'Multi Play FRP Station', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed><b>Multi Play FRP Station</b> are manufactured using supreme grade factor inputs under the strict supervision of our quality experts. In order to accomplish diverse requirements of our esteemed customers, we offer these products in numerous sizes, designs and colors. The offered range has a smooth and friction free axis that brings hours of joy and fun to children.\n<p xss=removed> </p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>Features :</b></p>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>\n <p xss=removed>Longer functional life</p>\n </li>\n <li xss=removed>\n <p xss=removed>High tensile strength</p>\n </li>\n <li xss=removed>\n <p xss=removed>Corrosion resistance</p>\n </li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<br>\n<b>Price Range:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>2 lakh to 10 lakh</li>\n</ul>\n \n\n<p xss=removed> </p>\n</div>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<div class=\"cl m14\" xss=removed><strong>Additional Information:</strong></div>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Item Code: </strong>PF-129</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 1.1 Lakh / Unit', '', 1),
(29, '', 'Multi Action Play Station', '', '', NULL, '<p><span xss=removed>Since our foundation, we are engaged in presenting an outstanding quality array of </span><b xss=removed>Multi Action Play Station</b><span xss=removed>. The offered equipments are developed in accordance with industry norms and quality parameters. In the offered equipments, the heavy cast plastic material has been used approved and certified by the authority. In addition, these equipments can be built and developed according to the latest market trends. Further, our professionals opt for strict quality inspection made on the equipments to ensure high performance. Besides, clients can get the equipments from us at reasonable prices.</span><br xss=removed>\n<br xss=removed>\n<b xss=removed>Features:</b><br xss=removed>\n </p>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Comfortable and easy</li>\n <li xss=removed>Looks attractive</li>\n <li xss=removed>Safe and friendly</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 5,000 / Unit', '', 1),
(30, '', 'Outdoor Multi Play Station', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>Leveraging on our in-house production unit, we are presenting a wide assortment of <b>Outdoor Multi Play Station</b>. This is a plastic moulded product developed using quality plastic material. This multiplay is manufactured adhering to international industry standards and quality norms to provide kids a safe play and peace-of-mind to parents. Such fabrication assists in delivering long working life and safety to the children. Further, the multiplay is check on various quality scales to assure better play. <br>\n<br>\n<b>Features:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Smooth surface</li>\n <li xss=removed>Available in different colors</li>\n <li xss=removed>Easy to install</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p xss=removed> </p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>Price Range:</b></p>\n \n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>2 lakh to 10 lakh</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p xss=removed> </p>\n</div>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<div class=\"cl m14\" xss=removed><strong>Additional Information:</strong></div>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Item Code: </strong>PF-124MPPS</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Port of Dispatch: </strong>AN FRIEGHT</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Production Capacity: </strong>1 TO 1000</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Delivery Time: </strong>10 TO 15 DAYS</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 2 Lakh / Unit', '', 1),
(31, '', 'Outdoor Children Playing Garden Slide And Swing', '', '', NULL, '<p><span xss=removed>Our products Outdoor Children Playing Garden Slide and Swing are widely acclaimed among the customers for their features like perfect polish, optimum finishing, scratch-proof nature and high durability. We export our products all over the world. Further, these products are tested by our quality controllers on various quality</span></p>\n\n<div> </div>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 57,999 / Piece', '', 4),
(32, '', 'Balancing Bridge', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>By keeping track of present market development, we are offering an outstanding range of <b>Balancing Bridge.</b> Our professionals manufacture this hammock swing utilizing the best quality material and sophisticated technology. Offered hammock swing is checked by our team of quality managers to ensure the flawlessness before dispatch. This array is made available in several specifications to choose from.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Features:</b>\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Easy to install</li>\n <li xss=removed>High strength</li>\n <li xss=removed>Weather resistance</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<b>Price Range:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>10,000 to 40,000/-</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<div class=\"cl m14\" xss=removed><strong>Additional Information:</strong></div>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Item Code: </strong>PF-412</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Port of Dispatch: </strong>SARWADNYA SPORTS AND FITNESS</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Delivery Time: </strong>10 TO 15 DAYS</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 10,000 / Unit', '', 4),
(33, '', 'FRP Amusement Park Equipment', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"he14\" id=\"prdcont3\" xss=removed>\n<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>We are providing an exclusive range of <b>FRP Amusement Park Equipment.</b> Owing to their longer life, these are enormously demand.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Features:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Sturdiness</li>\n <li xss=removed>Anti-corrosive</li>\n <li xss=removed>Water resistance</li>\n <li xss=removed>Nominal costs</li>\n <li xss=removed>Easy to use</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<b>Price Range:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>5,000 to 1,00,000/-</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n \n\n<div class=\"cl m14\" xss=removed><strong>Additional Information:</strong></div>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Port of Dispatch: </strong>SARWADNYA SPORTS AND FITNESS</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Delivery Time: </strong>10 TO 15 DAY</li>\n <li> </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 5,000 / Unit', '', 4),
(34, '', 'Nursery Slide Combo Set', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"he14\" id=\"prdcont4\" xss=removed>\n<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>Backed by our rich industrial experience in this domain, we are committed towards offering wide gamut of <b>Nursery Slide Combo Set.</b> Our products are fabricated by high quality material and contemporary tools in compliance with set industrial standards. Our offered set is made available in various specifications for our clients to choose from. We offer this set at affordable prices to our clients.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Specification : </b><br>\n<br>\nProviding & fixing nursery combo set FRP common Slide 2 no.\n<p xss=removed><b>2.</b>Providing & fixing Height 1.2m, Width of slide 0.5, Length of Slide each 3m. &</p>\n\n<p xss=removed>thickness of slide is 5 to 6 mm. frp sheet.</p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>3</b>.Main frame 40mmx2.5mm (thickness)@ NB. Pipe</p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>4</b>. Plate form of steel frame of 16g M.S. sheet with support of 25x25x3 angle</p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>5</b>.Ralling of 20x2mm (thickness) pipe</p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>6</b>.FRP should be 8 Length and 0.5 Mtr. Wide</p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>7</b>.Stairs made up of square pipe of 100x50mm.& 25x25x3 angle main frame, stairs & FRP should properly fixed with support of flat 40x5 with each other with nut bolting system. Ideal for the age group 4-14yrs.</p>\n<b>8.</b>Painting:- Structures have to be powder coated by best quality polyurethane paints.& should be provided with hole passes for proper grip fixing with 1:2:4 cement concrete<br>\n<br>\n<b>Features:</b>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Stable base</li>\n <li xss=removed>Water resistance</li>\n <li xss=removed>Smooth sliding</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<b>Price Range:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>20,000 to 40,000/-</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n \n\n<div class=\"cl m14\" xss=removed><strong>Additional Information:</strong></div>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Port of Dispatch: </strong>Sarwadnya Sports and Fitness</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Delivery Time: </strong>10 TO 15 DAYS</li>\n <li> </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 20,000 / Unit', '', 4),
(35, '', 'Playground Equipment', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"he14\" id=\"prdcont5\" xss=removed>\n<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>Our organization is an eminent name, which is engaged in delivering <b>Playground Equipment </b>to the respectable clients. The offered range of garden multi play units is available in various specifications in accordance with the esteemed clients. In addition to this, the offered range of Garden Multi Play Units is tested on several characteristics to ensure its adherence with the international quality norms and standards. <br>\n<br>\n<b>Features:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Durable</li>\n <li xss=removed>Withstand high loads</li>\n <li xss=removed>Corrosion resistant</li>\n <li xss=removed>Reliable</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<b>Price Range:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>5,000 to 1,00,000/-</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n \n\n<div class=\"cl m14\" xss=removed><strong>Additional Information:</strong></div>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Port of Dispatch: </strong>SARWADNYA SPORTS AND FITNESS</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Delivery Time: </strong>10 TO 15 DAYS</li>\n <li> </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 2.5 Lakh / Unit', '', 4),
(36, '', 'Fun Park Equipment', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"he14\" id=\"prdcont6\" xss=removed>\n<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>We are the prominent organization of this domain engaged in offering a wide spectrum of <b>Fun Park Equipment</b>. The offered equipment is developed in accordance to industry norms and quality parameters. In the offered equipment, our professionals use the approved material during the manufacturing process. In addition, this equipment can be built and developed according to the specification provided by the clients. Furthermore, our professionals opt for strict quality inspection made on the equipment to ensure high performance.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Features:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Attractive design</li>\n <li xss=removed>Easy to play and explain</li>\n <li xss=removed>Light weight and stable</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<b>Price Range:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>5,000 to 1,00,000/-</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n \n\n<div class=\"cl m14\" xss=removed><strong>Additional Information:</strong></div>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Port of Dispatch: </strong>SARWADNYA SPORTS AND FITNESS</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Production Capacity: </strong>1 to 1000</li>\n <li xss=removed><strong>Delivery Time: </strong>10 TO 15 DAY</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"fl m6 raq_btn\" xss=removed> </div>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 5,000 / Unit', '', 4),
(37, '', 'Outdoor Playground Equipment', '', '', NULL, '<p><span xss=removed>We are involved in providing a wide series of </span><b xss=removed>Playground Fiber Equipment</b><span xss=removed> that is made employing the best quality material and advanced techniques.</span><br xss=removed>\n<br xss=removed>\n<b xss=removed>Features:</b><br>\n </p>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Longer life</li>\n <li xss=removed>Low maintenance</li>\n <li xss=removed>Precise dimension</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><br>\n<b xss=removed>Price Range:</b></p>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>40000 to 3,00,000/-</li>\n <li> </li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 4.5 Lakh / Unit', '', 4),
(38, '', 'Garden Fiber Slide', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"he14\" id=\"prdcont8\" xss=removed>\n<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>\n<p xss=removed>Wide range of <b>Garden Fiber Slide</b> with various combinations of slides, crawling tunnel, climber, suspended bridge, etc. The gigantic structure aesthetically designed for catering a huge number of children at a time with maximum safety. The combination of various Amusement Park Equipments can be customized.</p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>Specification </b>:</p>\nAge group: 4-12 yrs.<br>\nProduct area: 6.7, x 1.4 mts<br>\nSafe play area: 7.7, x 2.4 mts<br>\nProduct height: 3.2 mts<br>\nPlatform height: 2.1 mts\n<p xss=removed><b>Price Range:</b></p>\n\n<p xss=removed>• 5,000 to 1,00,000/-</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 20,000 / Unit', '', 4),
(39, '', 'Amusement Park Multi Play Station', '', '', NULL, '<div class=\"he14\" id=\"prdcont9\" xss=removed>\n<div class=\"m14\" xss=removed>We feel proud to introduce ourselves as the leading organization in this domain, engaged in presenting an excellent grade of <b>Amusement Park Multi Play Station</b>. This equipment is developed using quality material and higher technologies. Our professionals opt for strict quality tests throughout the production of the equipment to guarantee optimum performance. The provided equipment is made accessible in different capacities. Provided equipment is built for heavy operations. Besides, clients can get the equipment from us at industry leading rates. <br>\n<br>\n<b>Specification : </b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Age group: 5-12 yrs.</li>\n <li xss=removed>Product area: 9.7, x 9.6 mts</li>\n <li xss=removed>Safe play area: 11.7, x 11.6 mts</li>\n <li xss=removed>Product height: 4.5 mts</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<b>Features:</b><br>\n \n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>Perfect height</li>\n <li xss=removed>Lightweight</li>\n <li xss=removed>High durability</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p xss=removed> </p>\n\n<p xss=removed><b>Price Range:</b></p>\n\n<p xss=removed> </p>\n\n<ul xss=removed>\n <li xss=removed>5,000/- -1,00,000/-</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n', NULL, '', '', 'Approx. Price: Rs 2.21 Lakh / Unit', '', 4);
